(1394023, 177984, 30018, '<td valign="top">I''m thinkin'' this would have been really awesome on a black background or even a very deep red background, maybe even better enough to be a winner!  I would have been easier to see the details in the glass, including the sweat which makes the glass look cold.  The pouring juice would have jumped off the page, and the apple with it''s highlights would have been well defined.  Very nice idea, just the wrong background in my opinin   &lt;5&gt;</td>', 'I''m thinkin'' this would have been really awesome on a black background or even a very deep red background, maybe even better enough to be a winner!  I would have been easier to see the details in the glass, including the sweat which makes the glass look cold.  The pouring juice would have jumped off the page, and the apple with it''s highlights would have been well defined.  Very nice idea, just the wrong background in my opinin   <5>', '2005-05-18 06:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1394026, 177755, 35467, '<td valign="top">Very good work ... Personally the desk could have been a little sharper and a real leaf on the apple. Good luck</td>', 'Very good work ... Personally the desk could have been a little sharper and a real leaf on the apple. Good luck', '2005-05-18 06:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
