(1394163, 178005, 36495, '<td valign="top">I had the same idea but was too busy with school and patients. GREAT expression and shes cute too. Your daughter?</td>', 'I had the same idea but was too busy with school and patients. GREAT expression and shes cute too. Your daughter?', '2005-05-18 08:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1394166, 177452, 30018, '<td valign="top">This is the image I was going to do, but ran out of time this week.  I''m glad someone did it.  And did it well.  Very nice textures in the leaves and flower pedals.  I really like the black background as well, which helps the image ''pop''.  Beautiful colors.  I hope this image does very well...its one of my favs!  &lt;9&gt;</td>', 'This is the image I was going to do, but ran out of time this week.  I''m glad someone did it.  And did it well.  Very nice textures in the leaves and flower pedals.  I really like the black background as well, which helps the image ''pop''.  Beautiful colors.  I hope this image does very well...its one of my favs!  <9>', '2005-05-18 08:40:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1394167, 177712, 36495, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. You have to tell us how you did it.</td>', 'Nice shot. You have to tell us how you did it.', '2005-05-18 08:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1394169, 177984, 36495, '<td valign="top">Tell me how...please. Great imagination and concept. I didn''t know apples had beer in them. OH...thats apple juice :)</td>', 'Tell me how...please. Great imagination and concept. I didn''t know apples had beer in them. OH...thats apple juice :)', '2005-05-18 08:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1394170, 178858, 36495, '<td valign="top">Wow thats a large apple! Nice shot.</td>', 'Wow thats a large apple! Nice shot.', '2005-05-18 08:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1394174, 179336, 36495, '<td valign="top">M.C. Escher was a great artist. Cool pic.</td>', 'M.C. Escher was a great artist. Cool pic.', '2005-05-18 08:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1394175, 178133, 30018, '<td valign="top">I like this image a lot.  It''s softness is different than most pictures like this.  A nice sharp drop of water and stem, adds just a touch of detail in the very shallow DOF image.  Just a thought...I wonder if a slightly different colored background might have helped define the shape of the apple rather than blending with it, since the edges of the apple are blurred due to the DOF.    &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'I like this image a lot.  It''s softness is different than most pictures like this.  A nice sharp drop of water and stem, adds just a touch of detail in the very shallow DOF image.  Just a thought...I wonder if a slightly different colored background might have helped define the shape of the apple rather than blending with it, since the edges of the apple are blurred due to the DOF.    <7>', '2005-05-18 08:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1394176, 178749, 36495, '<td valign="top">Like the pic. Shirt might be just a little washed out, but I still like it.</td>', 'Like the pic. Shirt might be just a little washed out, but I still like it.', '2005-05-18 08:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1394180, 178026, 36495, '<td valign="top">Cool concept. Like the pic.</td>', 'Cool concept. Like the pic.', '2005-05-18 08:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1394181, 177261, 32513, '<td valign="top">This is pretty cool lookin, but I''d try and get a larger drop coming out of the spigot.</td>', 'This is pretty cool lookin, but I''d try and get a larger drop coming out of the spigot.', '2005-05-18 08:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1394183, 179089, 36495, '<td valign="top">Great colors. I like it.</td>', 'Great colors. I like it.', '2005-05-18 08:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1394186, 178137, 33924, '<td valign="top">I love the rich colors of the apple in your photo and the sense of very sharp areas combined with soft edges. The greenness of the stem looks a little oddly colored to me, but all in all a stunning photo! Cutey!!</td>', 'I love the rich colors of the apple in your photo and the sense of very sharp areas combined with soft edges. The greenness of the stem looks a little oddly colored to me, but all in all a stunning photo! Cutey!!', '2005-05-18 08:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1394187, 179250, 36495, '<td valign="top">Nice pic. I usually dont like borders, but I think It might help this one.</td>', 'Nice pic. I usually dont like borders, but I think It might help this one.', '2005-05-18 08:49:30.000000', NULL, 1),
