(1394189, 179333, 30018, '<td valign="top">Very nice image.  Love the lighting, the textures, the detail and the colors.  I''ve always been a fan of the black background, but for some reason, this one seems to need something to rest on.  I''m not sure why, but it looks slightly awkward.  I still love the image, and think it will do very well.  &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'Very nice image.  Love the lighting, the textures, the detail and the colors.  I''ve always been a fan of the black background, but for some reason, this one seems to need something to rest on.  I''m not sure why, but it looks slightly awkward.  I still love the image, and think it will do very well.  <7>', '2005-05-18 08:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
