(1394498, 178284, 32633, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice image. I reall like the placement of the apple as well as the coloring and angle from which you shot this.</td>', 'This is a very nice image. I reall like the placement of the apple as well as the coloring and angle from which you shot this.', '2005-05-18 10:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1394502, 177702, 35804, '<td valign="top">This is just so juicy...no pun intended, or maybe it was. The light is so ethereal and the shine on the apples is divine. I would have loved to have seen this with more black above the sea of apples, a more squarish, "normal" canvas size with the apples in the bottom 1/3 or so...I just find this sort of long, squat cropping somewhat disconcerting and un-natural. I think maybe more black "breathing room" above would have made the apples "pop" even more than they do now...they are absolutely gorgeous.</td>', 'This is just so juicy...no pun intended, or maybe it was. The light is so ethereal and the shine on the apples is divine. I would have loved to have seen this with more black above the sea of apples, a more squarish, "normal" canvas size with the apples in the bottom 1/3 or so...I just find this sort of long, squat cropping somewhat disconcerting and un-natural. I think maybe more black "breathing room" above would have made the apples "pop" even more than they do now...they are absolutely gorgeous.', '2005-05-18 10:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1394503, 179239, 32633, '<td valign="top">This is a nice image. I really like the fact that you shot this image in blacka and white and the detail and texture that can be seen.</td>', 'This is a nice image. I really like the fact that you shot this image in blacka and white and the detail and texture that can be seen.', '2005-05-18 10:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
