(1394548, 179326, 35352, '<td valign="top">This is what photography is about for me. This looks more real than life itself. While the subject is not overly interesting and the photo a little dark, the detail is v. impresive. I love the quality of the apple. It also looks like the apple deserves to be on a bed of roses -&gt; it hasn''t just been placed there. 9.</td>', 'This is what photography is about for me. This looks more real than life itself. While the subject is not overly interesting and the photo a little dark, the detail is v. impresive. I love the quality of the apple. It also looks like the apple deserves to be on a bed of roses -> it hasn''t just been placed there. 9.', '2005-05-18 11:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
