(1395813, 179336, 35804, '<td valign="top">Super duper creative! This is just fantastic! What I love about this image is that it DEMANDS a closer look, it absolutely requires it...and those who do not want to give the image some time will simply miss out. The B &amp; W is very effective, makes the image more "challenging"...wouldn''t be the same in color...the light is also nice... dim, ( in a good way ) simple and also very effective... very well done. 10</td>', 'Super duper creative! This is just fantastic! What I love about this image is that it DEMANDS a closer look, it absolutely requires it...and those who do not want to give the image some time will simply miss out. The B & W is very effective, makes the image more "challenging"...wouldn''t be the same in color...the light is also nice... dim, ( in a good way ) simple and also very effective... very well done. 10', '2005-05-18 17:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
