(1397365, 179267, 23579, '<td valign="top">I would have prefered to have the lighting so that the sides of the left and right apple weren''t blown out. Maybe it''s hard because apples are pretty shiny.</td>', 'I would have prefered to have the lighting so that the sides of the left and right apple weren''t blown out. Maybe it''s hard because apples are pretty shiny.', '2005-05-19 03:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
