(1397392, 178775, 38011, '<td valign="top">Very nice!!!!!</td>', 'Very nice!!!!!', '2005-05-19 03:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397398, 177969, 38011, '<td valign="top">Should be called One Bad Apple</td>', 'Should be called One Bad Apple', '2005-05-19 03:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397415, 177984, 7252, '<td valign="top">Nice n'' sharp but I just wish it didn''t look like the apple was urinating in a glass.</td>', 'Nice n'' sharp but I just wish it didn''t look like the apple was urinating in a glass.', '2005-05-19 04:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397422, 179339, 7252, '<td valign="top">Kind of reminds me of a dutch painting. A little too dark though.</td>', 'Kind of reminds me of a dutch painting. A little too dark though.', '2005-05-19 04:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397431, 178005, 16241, '<td valign="top">cute!  send her to holywood immediately</td>', 'cute!  send her to holywood immediately', '2005-05-19 04:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397433, 178987, 21604, '<td valign="top">I like this, nice idea for the photo, but let down slightly by the dust on the mirrored surfce. 7</td>', 'I like this, nice idea for the photo, but let down slightly by the dust on the mirrored surfce. 7', '2005-05-19 04:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397434, 179202, 16241, '<td valign="top">hope you dont get voted down for the title, great photo!</td>', 'hope you dont get voted down for the title, great photo!', '2005-05-19 04:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397436, 179268, 21604, '<td valign="top">The picture is too soft, no real focal point.</td>', 'The picture is too soft, no real focal point.', '2005-05-19 04:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397438, 179341, 21604, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition, but the apples need to be sharper.</td>', 'Very nice composition, but the apples need to be sharper.', '2005-05-19 04:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397439, 178392, 21604, '<td valign="top">Love this shot, nice and sharp with great colors.</td>', 'Love this shot, nice and sharp with great colors.', '2005-05-19 04:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397441, 179324, 21604, '<td valign="top">The focus is not great - needs to be a lot sharper.</td>', 'The focus is not great - needs to be a lot sharper.', '2005-05-19 04:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397444, 179173, 28750, '<td valign="top">too dark for my taste</td>', 'too dark for my taste', '2005-05-19 04:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397449, 179123, 36616, '<td valign="top">Lighting a bit high on the top, a shield may have been useful. Just thoughts whilst in the critiquing mode. Good capture, good focus good dof, well done on something different.</td>', 'Lighting a bit high on the top, a shield may have been useful. Just thoughts whilst in the critiquing mode. Good capture, good focus good dof, well done on something different.', '2005-05-19 05:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397450, 178848, 36616, '<td valign="top">sorry but its out of focus.</td>', 'sorry but its out of focus.', '2005-05-19 05:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397451, 179346, 36616, '<td valign="top">Great idea, LOL. good capture, focus etc.</td>', 'Great idea, LOL. good capture, focus etc.', '2005-05-19 05:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397459, 179335, 30018, '<td valign="top">Nice image, but I''m not sure it stirs as much interest as many of the other images in this challenge.  I am a fan of the black background, but this may be too much.  Maybe had we been able to see half of the apple without the lower shadow on the left side of the apple, it would have been a more interesting image.  &lt;5&gt;</td>', 'Nice image, but I''m not sure it stirs as much interest as many of the other images in this challenge.  I am a fan of the black background, but this may be too much.  Maybe had we been able to see half of the apple without the lower shadow on the left side of the apple, it would have been a more interesting image.  <5>', '2005-05-19 06:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397460, 179379, 30018, '<td valign="top">That is interesting.  I little different twist.  Sharp photography, but lacking any true highlights.  Looks as if the photo was taken on a gloomy day with now additional lighting.  I do like the sharp focus, and the use of DOF to blow out the background.  &lt;6&gt;</td>', 'That is interesting.  I little different twist.  Sharp photography, but lacking any true highlights.  Looks as if the photo was taken on a gloomy day with now additional lighting.  I do like the sharp focus, and the use of DOF to blow out the background.  <6>', '2005-05-19 06:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397462, 178267, 30018, '<td valign="top">Nice image, with some nice qualities, including some different textures, nice skin tones, excellent lighting, and my favorite background... It is, however, lacking the interest factor to hold my attention for very long.  &lt;6&gt;</td>', 'Nice image, with some nice qualities, including some different textures, nice skin tones, excellent lighting, and my favorite background... It is, however, lacking the interest factor to hold my attention for very long.  <6>', '2005-05-19 06:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397466, 177255, 30018, '<td valign="top">There are some great colors going on in this image.  This back lighting technique really makes the vase stand out nicely, but tends to draw the eye away from the apples which are mostly in the shadows.  I do like the water droplets on the apples, which add texture and points of light, however, the vase still remains the dominate feature in this image, to me.  &lt;6&gt;</td>', 'There are some great colors going on in this image.  This back lighting technique really makes the vase stand out nicely, but tends to draw the eye away from the apples which are mostly in the shadows.  I do like the water droplets on the apples, which add texture and points of light, however, the vase still remains the dominate feature in this image, to me.  <6>', '2005-05-19 06:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397467, 179392, 30018, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice approach to this challenge.  Much like the apple blossoms, the apple seeds are an important part of the apple.  Did you know they are posionous?  I find this image interesting, due to the lighting.  This looks trans-lucent.  I like the detail in the seed and the varying tones of color throughout the apple.  I hope people take a longer look at this image, and dont skip over it quickly, as there are some very wonderful things gong on here.  &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'This is a very nice approach to this challenge.  Much like the apple blossoms, the apple seeds are an important part of the apple.  Did you know they are posionous?  I find this image interesting, due to the lighting.  This looks trans-lucent.  I like the detail in the seed and the varying tones of color throughout the apple.  I hope people take a longer look at this image, and dont skip over it quickly, as there are some very wonderful things gong on here.  <8>', '2005-05-19 06:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397470, 179366, 30018, '<td valign="top">Nice image, but I''m not sure it stirs as much interest as many of the other images in this challenge.  I am a fan of the black background, but this may be too much.  Maybe had we been able to see half of the apple without the lower shadow on the left side of the apple, it would have been a more interesting image.  This is slightly more interesting than the other image submitted which is very similiar, probably due to the water droplets which catch the light and provide more points of light. &lt;5&gt;</td>', 'Nice image, but I''m not sure it stirs as much interest as many of the other images in this challenge.  I am a fan of the black background, but this may be too much.  Maybe had we been able to see half of the apple without the lower shadow on the left side of the apple, it would have been a more interesting image.  This is slightly more interesting than the other image submitted which is very similiar, probably due to the water droplets which catch the light and provide more points of light. <5>', '2005-05-19 06:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397471, 178579, 30018, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy these types of shots where people have concentrated on something other than the apple as a whole.  This is stunning, and it''s only a silly stem.  Great focus, and nice DOF.  I would love to see this image on a black background.  The red is not bad, but I can see this litterally jumping off the page with a black background.  &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'I really enjoy these types of shots where people have concentrated on something other than the apple as a whole.  This is stunning, and it''s only a silly stem.  Great focus, and nice DOF.  I would love to see this image on a black background.  The red is not bad, but I can see this litterally jumping off the page with a black background.  <7>', '2005-05-19 06:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397472, 179119, 35720, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but I think the composition might be better.</td>', 'Nice shot but I think the composition might be better.', '2005-05-19 06:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397473, 177652, 30018, '<td valign="top">I see two yellows and three reds...I thought you said only one does not belong.  Nice image.  Nice idea.  I do kinda feel like I''m sliding down a hill with image.  There are a lot of different textures going on in this image, from the fruit to the wood to the corn leaf and pine cone.  Ohhhh....I get it....it''s the pine cone that doesn''t belong.  J/K of course.  &lt;6&gt;</td>', 'I see two yellows and three reds...I thought you said only one does not belong.  Nice image.  Nice idea.  I do kinda feel like I''m sliding down a hill with image.  There are a lot of different textures going on in this image, from the fruit to the wood to the corn leaf and pine cone.  Ohhhh....I get it....it''s the pine cone that doesn''t belong.  J/K of course.  <6>', '2005-05-19 06:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397475, 177470, 30018, '<td valign="top">This is a nice image, but I think it would have benefitted greatly from a dark red or even a black background, and a reflector on the left side.   I am personally not a fan of white backgrounds, and am not holding that against your image, it''s just my personal preference.  I like the idea.  I love the heart shape.  I like how you have recreated the apple after slicing it.  Lighting seems a little harsh on the right, as details in the whites of the apple seem to be lost on the right side.  &lt;6&gt;</td>', 'This is a nice image, but I think it would have benefitted greatly from a dark red or even a black background, and a reflector on the left side.   I am personally not a fan of white backgrounds, and am not holding that against your image, it''s just my personal preference.  I like the idea.  I love the heart shape.  I like how you have recreated the apple after slicing it.  Lighting seems a little harsh on the right, as details in the whites of the apple seem to be lost on the right side.  <6>', '2005-05-19 06:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397476, 179340, 30018, '<td valign="top">This is very different, and I like it.  Nice lighting, nice texture, nice DOF, and the red in the background is a great idea.  Nicely done.  &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'This is very different, and I like it.  Nice lighting, nice texture, nice DOF, and the red in the background is a great idea.  Nicely done.  <7>', '2005-05-19 06:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397477, 179215, 30018, '<td valign="top">This picture reminds me of the ol'' Kodak books that used to describe how red and green filters worked, except this apple isn''t red, it''s as green as the leaves.  Those leaves are all so perfect.  Not a hint of decay anywhere.  Are they real?  This is an interesting shot which has held my attention, as I study the textures and the lighting, and shadows.  This single-colored image is quite stunning and should do well.  &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'This picture reminds me of the ol'' Kodak books that used to describe how red and green filters worked, except this apple isn''t red, it''s as green as the leaves.  Those leaves are all so perfect.  Not a hint of decay anywhere.  Are they real?  This is an interesting shot which has held my attention, as I study the textures and the lighting, and shadows.  This single-colored image is quite stunning and should do well.  <8>', '2005-05-19 06:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397478, 179059, 30018, '<td valign="top">Nice color.  I''m not sure what is going on in that glass, whether the texture is coming from the glass or what is inside the glass, but I like it.  I love the colors in the apple.  I''m not sure if the "fuzzy white tail" thing adds to the image or not.  For me it seems a bit distracting....but that''s just me.  Overall, this is a nice shot.  &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'Nice color.  I''m not sure what is going on in that glass, whether the texture is coming from the glass or what is inside the glass, but I like it.  I love the colors in the apple.  I''m not sure if the "fuzzy white tail" thing adds to the image or not.  For me it seems a bit distracting....but that''s just me.  Overall, this is a nice shot.  <7>', '2005-05-19 06:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397479, 179262, 24983, '<td valign="top">An interesting shot with a little piece of history which adds interest for me , the background is nicely out of focus as well 9</td>', 'An interesting shot with a little piece of history which adds interest for me , the background is nicely out of focus as well 9', '2005-05-19 06:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397480, 179279, 30018, '<td valign="top">Every challenge seems to get the subject of pool in it.  Why should this one be any different.  This is nicly done.  Lighted well, with some very nice focusing on the entire bushel, if you will.  I like the different types of apples in this image.  &lt;6&gt;</td>', 'Every challenge seems to get the subject of pool in it.  Why should this one be any different.  This is nicly done.  Lighted well, with some very nice focusing on the entire bushel, if you will.  I like the different types of apples in this image.  <6>', '2005-05-19 06:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397481, 178881, 24983, '<td valign="top">well captured , a difficult type of capture 10</td>', 'well captured , a difficult type of capture 10', '2005-05-19 06:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397483, 177364, 24983, '<td valign="top">Quite different thinking rather salvador Dalish in its speaking to me weird in fact Hmmmm 9</td>', 'Quite different thinking rather salvador Dalish in its speaking to me weird in fact Hmmmm 9', '2005-05-19 06:56:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397484, 178024, 30018, '<td valign="top">Some beautiful colors and textures, and isn''t it odd to see a blossom that is so pretty and new, next to a peice of fruit so farly developed.  I love the detail in the flowers and the soft light which illuminates them.  I''m glad there are now harsh glares in this image like there are in most from this challenge.  Very nice shot.  Among my favs.  &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'Some beautiful colors and textures, and isn''t it odd to see a blossom that is so pretty and new, next to a peice of fruit so farly developed.  I love the detail in the flowers and the soft light which illuminates them.  I''m glad there are now harsh glares in this image like there are in most from this challenge.  Very nice shot.  Among my favs.  <8>', '2005-05-19 06:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397486, 179341, 30018, '<td valign="top">Nice image.  Nicely lit with a varity of apples.  Great capture of the glass in the dark.  This image should do quite well.  &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'Nice image.  Nicely lit with a varity of apples.  Great capture of the glass in the dark.  This image should do quite well.  <7>', '2005-05-19 06:59:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397487, 178543, 35720, '<td valign="top">Very good shot. It would have been even better if the stalk was still on the apple, but a great shot though with a good use of ahallow DOF.</td>', 'Very good shot. It would have been even better if the stalk was still on the apple, but a great shot though with a good use of ahallow DOF.', '2005-05-19 07:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397488, 179380, 24983, '<td valign="top">there are people on this site with vivid imaginations that they unleash on the unsuspecting voters I suspect that yo are one of them, I like the image but am a little unsure of its message.  10</td>', 'there are people on this site with vivid imaginations that they unleash on the unsuspecting voters I suspect that yo are one of them, I like the image but am a little unsure of its message.  10', '2005-05-19 07:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397490, 177628, 30018, '<td valign="top">Something about this image just doesn''t look sharp to me.  Although there are details, I can''t seem to pick out any DOF...almost as if the camera was too close to the apples.  It''s a nice composition, with some great colors and nice lighting, but just overall OOF.  &lt;5&gt;</td>', 'Something about this image just doesn''t look sharp to me.  Although there are details, I can''t seem to pick out any DOF...almost as if the camera was too close to the apples.  It''s a nice composition, with some great colors and nice lighting, but just overall OOF.  <5>', '2005-05-19 07:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397492, 178702, 30018, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting on the hand.  The apple, however, seems not to be ing real sharp focus, and is back lit enough that the hand which is well lit and has great detail, becomes the more interesting part of this image. &lt;5&gt;</td>', 'Beautiful lighting on the hand.  The apple, however, seems not to be ing real sharp focus, and is back lit enough that the hand which is well lit and has great detail, becomes the more interesting part of this image. <5>', '2005-05-19 07:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397494, 179233, 30018, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors.  Great use of water to add points of light.  Super composition.  Very nice image, that should finish in the top 10.  &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'Wonderful colors.  Great use of water to add points of light.  Super composition.  Very nice image, that should finish in the top 10.  <8>', '2005-05-19 07:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397496, 178392, 24983, '<td valign="top">It looks if granny has a bladder control problem with the amount of liquid sprayed around, never mind If brings on the votes, A nice little image with a piquancy all of its own In its defence it is nicelly exposed the background has a subtle darkish tone and it is an apple   I will spoil you with a 9 and the  wish you may ribbon.</td>', 'It looks if granny has a bladder control problem with the amount of liquid sprayed around, never mind If brings on the votes, A nice little image with a piquancy all of its own In its defence it is nicelly exposed the background has a subtle darkish tone and it is an apple   I will spoil you with a 9 and the  wish you may ribbon.', '2005-05-19 07:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
