(1397625, 178848, 36981, '<td valign="top">I"m one of the many who submitted a William Tell picture, so I like your idea but I''m guessing that you''re not getting many points for originality.  This one is a little too blurry for me, and I think that a simple photo editing program could have helped make the color of the apple a little more vibrant, &amp; the color of the man''s face a little less so!</td>', 'I"m one of the many who submitted a William Tell picture, so I like your idea but I''m guessing that you''re not getting many points for originality.  This one is a little too blurry for me, and I think that a simple photo editing program could have helped make the color of the apple a little more vibrant, & the color of the man''s face a little less so!', '2005-05-19 08:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397628, 179356, 37334, '<td valign="top">Clever:)) I like the quirky angle and the negative space. 8</td>', 'Clever:)) I like the quirky angle and the negative space. 8', '2005-05-19 08:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397629, 177968, 36981, '<td valign="top">You captured the red on the apple really well.  I think the inside of the apple is, in my opinion, not very appetizing.  Perhaps it was too long before you got the shot?  Also, it would have worked better for me if the slicing lines were cleaner.</td>', 'You captured the red on the apple really well.  I think the inside of the apple is, in my opinion, not very appetizing.  Perhaps it was too long before you got the shot?  Also, it would have worked better for me if the slicing lines were cleaner.', '2005-05-19 08:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397630, 178969, 36981, '<td valign="top">I think this was a neat idea, but the apple is way overexposed on the side.  I"m not fond of the background - all those wrinkles are distracting.  It might have worked better if there was no carpet in the shot.  The wrinkly cloth might not have been so noticeable if it had extended under the apple as well.</td>', 'I think this was a neat idea, but the apple is way overexposed on the side.  I"m not fond of the background - all those wrinkles are distracting.  It might have worked better if there was no carpet in the shot.  The wrinkly cloth might not have been so noticeable if it had extended under the apple as well.', '2005-05-19 08:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397632, 177958, 36981, '<td valign="top">I like the reflection in the knife, but I found all the background elements really distracting, as well as whatever the apple is sitting on.  I think that the bottom apple is a bit overexposed as well.</td>', 'I like the reflection in the knife, but I found all the background elements really distracting, as well as whatever the apple is sitting on.  I think that the bottom apple is a bit overexposed as well.', '2005-05-19 08:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397633, 176965, 31443, '<td valign="top">The blue of the table takes a lot of attention away from the apple, pitty really it''s a good view of the apple and nice lighting although the apple itself has a shadow..</td>', 'The blue of the table takes a lot of attention away from the apple, pitty really it''s a good view of the apple and nice lighting although the apple itself has a shadow..', '2005-05-19 08:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
