(1397759, 177470, 327, '<td valign="top">Normally I would say the lighting is harsh, but think here it all works. The shadow is the problem I see and it''s a little distracting on the left. Over all a fine job, good color, and it''s in focus. Good entry for this challenge...and nice slices!!</td>', 'Normally I would say the lighting is harsh, but think here it all works. The shadow is the problem I see and it''s a little distracting on the left. Over all a fine job, good color, and it''s in focus. Good entry for this challenge...and nice slices!!', '2005-05-19 10:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397760, 179250, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice presentation. The light is a little strong but I think this works okay. Good luck.</td>', 'Nice presentation. The light is a little strong but I think this works okay. Good luck.', '2005-05-19 10:10:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397762, 179059, 30757, '<td valign="top">Strange combination, hard glas and the white stuff. I like the reflection in the glass. The only thing i can say, maybe it was more nice if the apple was a little bit more sharp. Now more attention is going to the glas and the funny white stuff. I saw the other martini, but i like to get drunk of this one.<br/></td>', 'Strange combination, hard glas and the white stuff. I like the reflection in the glass. The only thing i can say, maybe it was more nice if the apple was a little bit more sharp. Now more attention is going to the glas and the funny white stuff. I saw the other martini, but i like to get drunk of this one.', '2005-05-19 10:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1397763, 179031, 19841, '<td valign="top">This would be sooo much more appealing in color.</td>', 'This would be sooo much more appealing in color.', '2005-05-19 10:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
