(1397781, 179324, 327, '<td valign="top">I don''t see a ghost here...I see an apple slice and coffe cup that are out of focus.<br/>From this view the apple (if in focus) is really pretty and the pattern is good to look at. Maybe a different composition would of scored this higher.</td>', 'I don''t see a ghost here...I see an apple slice and coffe cup that are out of focus.From this view the apple (if in focus) is really pretty and the pattern is good to look at. Maybe a different composition would of scored this higher.', '2005-05-19 10:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
