(1397788, 179384, 327, '<td valign="top">With the apple in the horizon of the tree line .......it''s lost. The colors are flat, I''m guessing this was at sundown? The light is very low and the focus is a bit too soft.</td>', 'With the apple in the horizon of the tree line .......it''s lost. The colors are flat, I''m guessing this was at sundown? The light is very low and the focus is a bit too soft.', '2005-05-19 10:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
