(1398308, 178284, 37103, '<td valign="top">It looks like the apple is hanging out checking out the view.  Very secretive, I wonder what is on the other side of the vines.  It would be nice to have the vines more in focus.  Good composition.</td>', 'It looks like the apple is hanging out checking out the view.  Very secretive, I wonder what is on the other side of the vines.  It would be nice to have the vines more in focus.  Good composition.', '2005-05-19 13:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
