(1398311, 178443, 37103, '<td valign="top">This is very bizarre and I love it.  I would prefer not to see the line in the upper left corner, and to have a closer crop of the apple.  It looks like a little universe.</td>', 'This is very bizarre and I love it.  I would prefer not to see the line in the upper left corner, and to have a closer crop of the apple.  It looks like a little universe.', '2005-05-19 13:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1398313, 178152, 35947, '<td valign="top">little dark but well composed</td>', 'little dark but well composed', '2005-05-19 13:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1398328, 178848, 15207, '<td valign="top">This is a great concept. It''s a shame it''s so blurry and grainy. I''m wondernig if it was a much larger picture and you cropped it - I only say that because of the blur. Also, you may want to experiment a bit with your camera''s white balance. The face is quite abnormally orange. Sometimes you can change it on your camera to say indoors, flourescent light, outdoors on a cloudy day, etc.</td>', 'This is a great concept. It''s a shame it''s so blurry and grainy. I''m wondernig if it was a much larger picture and you cropped it - I only say that because of the blur. Also, you may want to experiment a bit with your camera''s white balance. The face is quite abnormally orange. Sometimes you can change it on your camera to say indoors, flourescent light, outdoors on a cloudy day, etc.', '2005-05-19 13:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1398331, 179366, 35720, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, simple and effective!</td>', 'Beautiful, simple and effective!', '2005-05-19 13:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
