(1398833, 178848, 27845, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea showing that the arrow hit the head first. Unfortunately, the injury on the head is barely visible because your image is out of focus. Try to take your image in brighter light, it might help your camera to find the focal point, and the shorter exposures will prevent motion blur or shaking. 5.</td>', 'Excellent idea showing that the arrow hit the head first. Unfortunately, the injury on the head is barely visible because your image is out of focus. Try to take your image in brighter light, it might help your camera to find the focal point, and the shorter exposures will prevent motion blur or shaking. 5.', '2005-05-19 17:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
