(1398869, 178749, 22734, '<td valign="top">Sexy shots always welcomed. A sharper focus, say starting with the closest book to the camera would have given this image that extra edge. A very good composition. Bump up two notches.</td>', 'Sexy shots always welcomed. A sharper focus, say starting with the closest book to the camera would have given this image that extra edge. A very good composition. Bump up two notches.', '2005-05-19 17:16:13.000000', NULL, 1),
