(1398877, 179229, 27440, '<td valign="top">Nice light!  It''s so strange in a positive way. The apple seems to cut off from the background! The idea is ok I guess. The fact that it is in focus and the colours are so vivid is a big plus. The shadow swollows only the oranges but the apple stays intact that''s a good idea :)  I give you a 6-7. Have to make up my mind first :)</td>', 'Nice light!  It''s so strange in a positive way. The apple seems to cut off from the background! The idea is ok I guess. The fact that it is in focus and the colours are so vivid is a big plus. The shadow swollows only the oranges but the apple stays intact that''s a good idea :)  I give you a 6-7. Have to make up my mind first :)', '2005-05-19 17:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
