(1398925, 178055, 35741, '<td valign="top">So far the best apple photo I have seen here. A simple and a clear pic with courageous and succesful cropping. Good luck!</td>', 'So far the best apple photo I have seen here. A simple and a clear pic with courageous and succesful cropping. Good luck!', '2005-05-19 17:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1398926, 179279, 27440, '<td valign="top">Haha good one! Creative and that''s what I like!!!  The off center look is ok, but too bad that these apples on the right create a curve not a straight line :( Damn such a detail but it drives me mad :)  I don''t like the tripple shadows. If  I may propose something - I would give a less direct lighting to avoid sharp shadows or If you wanted to have sharp shadows then maybe you should do it so that there is only one? Don''t know it''s just a suggestion. Anyway creativity comes first. You can always learn technical aspect and you can improve you technics but creativity is something that doesn''t come by learning :)   It''s a  7 for the idea. But I feel that a 6 would be better :)   Well I give you a chance hehe.</td>', 'Haha good one! Creative and that''s what I like!!!  The off center look is ok, but too bad that these apples on the right create a curve not a straight line :( Damn such a detail but it drives me mad :)  I don''t like the tripple shadows. If  I may propose something - I would give a less direct lighting to avoid sharp shadows or If you wanted to have sharp shadows then maybe you should do it so that there is only one? Don''t know it''s just a suggestion. Anyway creativity comes first. You can always learn technical aspect and you can improve you technics but creativity is something that doesn''t come by learning :)   It''s a  7 for the idea. But I feel that a 6 would be better :)   Well I give you a chance hehe.', '2005-05-19 17:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1398930, 177782, 27440, '<td valign="top">many people will say it''s off topic. Since the topic said clearly THE FRUIT. I however will not mark you down for this. I understand the picture and the topic so it''s ok with me :)  The yellow below is horrible. You could try a soft focus in here. Not sure if the sharp image is working well here. It''s a 5 I guess.</td>', 'many people will say it''s off topic. Since the topic said clearly THE FRUIT. I however will not mark you down for this. I understand the picture and the topic so it''s ok with me :)  The yellow below is horrible. You could try a soft focus in here. Not sure if the sharp image is working well here. It''s a 5 I guess.', '2005-05-19 17:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1398935, 178137, 27440, '<td valign="top">I like it but too bad you can feel this heavy ps grip :(   My guess is that You overexposed the image and tried to heal it. Don''t know if I am right but- is this shadow natural ? Because it doesn''t consume the apple in a shadowy way but you can see straight lines.  As if a polygon.  I am sorry if I am wrong but that''s my impression.</td>', 'I like it but too bad you can feel this heavy ps grip :(   My guess is that You overexposed the image and tried to heal it. Don''t know if I am right but- is this shadow natural ? Because it doesn''t consume the apple in a shadowy way but you can see straight lines.  As if a polygon.  I am sorry if I am wrong but that''s my impression.', '2005-05-19 17:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
