(1398998, 178656, 35741, '<td valign="top">I think there is too little light in this picture. The idea is worth re-shooting. Try this: put apples out on a cloudy weather, spray water on them and reflect light from down with a styrox plate.</td>', 'I think there is too little light in this picture. The idea is worth re-shooting. Try this: put apples out on a cloudy weather, spray water on them and reflect light from down with a styrox plate.', '2005-05-19 17:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
