(1399014, 179047, 35741, '<td valign="top">This fruit reminds more radish than apple... I think this photo lacks backlight and some other object its size could be compared with.</td>', 'This fruit reminds more radish than apple... I think this photo lacks backlight and some other object its size could be compared with.', '2005-05-19 18:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
