(1399024, 179306, 27440, '<td valign="top">it feels so alive. Really I love it!</td>', 'it feels so alive. Really I love it!', '2005-05-19 18:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399030, 177973, 37395, '<td valign="top">Simple and beautiful. The apple and the snail are perfect.<br/>I love it.</td>', 'Simple and beautiful. The apple and the snail are perfect.I love it.', '2005-05-19 18:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399041, 178317, 37395, '<td valign="top">It''s a good idea when you don''t know what to do with a camera and an apple :D....<br/>The Idea is nice..<br/>I like it.  :)</td>', 'It''s a good idea when you don''t know what to do with a camera and an apple :D....The Idea is nice..I like it.  :)', '2005-05-19 18:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399042, 177705, 37395, '<td valign="top">Artistic</td>', 'Artistic', '2005-05-19 18:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399047, 179343, 19831, '<td valign="top">Great idea here. I like the humor factor :-) I really like the yellow background you''ve used, adds a lot of punch to this shot IMO. I also like the narrow, tight cropping/framing, I think it works very well for this image. Focus seems like it could perhaps be just a tad crisper, and there is a small glare spot on the right side of the apple, but just a minor distracting. Overall, a pleasant little photo :-)</td>', 'Great idea here. I like the humor factor :-) I really like the yellow background you''ve used, adds a lot of punch to this shot IMO. I also like the narrow, tight cropping/framing, I think it works very well for this image. Focus seems like it could perhaps be just a tad crisper, and there is a small glare spot on the right side of the apple, but just a minor distracting. Overall, a pleasant little photo :-)', '2005-05-19 18:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399049, 179354, 37395, '<td valign="top">This cut it''s a very good idea...<br/>Simply like it  :)</td>', 'This cut it''s a very good idea...Simply like it  :)', '2005-05-19 18:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399058, 177159, 19831, '<td valign="top">A nice idea here. I like the overall composition, I think it works well. The look in the models eyes is great! Really helps make the shot. It feels like the lighting is just a tad bit harsh, not too bad, but a little. I''m also wondering if the arrow point were not quite so close, a little further out, with a little room to "breath", maybe it would make a slightly stronger presentation?</td>', 'A nice idea here. I like the overall composition, I think it works well. The look in the models eyes is great! Really helps make the shot. It feels like the lighting is just a tad bit harsh, not too bad, but a little. I''m also wondering if the arrow point were not quite so close, a little further out, with a little room to "breath", maybe it would make a slightly stronger presentation?', '2005-05-19 18:31:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399059, 179034, 30896, '<td valign="top">seems a bit noisy - or is it just my monitor?</td>', 'seems a bit noisy - or is it just my monitor?', '2005-05-19 18:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
