(1399070, 178119, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very nice concept here. I like the composition. The water drops on the apple are a nice touch. I''m thinking maybe the dof could be more even, the front side of the apple seems a little off.</td>', 'Very nice concept here. I like the composition. The water drops on the apple are a nice touch. I''m thinking maybe the dof could be more even, the front side of the apple seems a little off.', '2005-05-19 18:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399075, 178085, 327, '<td valign="top">That woodie can sure get into some fun positions!! He is just like ATLAS here. :)<br/>What a guy. This shot is very good, in focus, but a bit bright on the white part of the apple. It''s a good entry for the challenge, good luck.</td>', 'That woodie can sure get into some fun positions!! He is just like ATLAS here. :)What a guy. This shot is very good, in focus, but a bit bright on the white part of the apple. It''s a good entry for the challenge, good luck.', '2005-05-19 18:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
