(1399090, 178044, 29282, '<td valign="top">Great pic.  I rated it very high but wish it was a bit sharper.   But on the other hand I figure that you intended it to have a soft look.  Anyway, good work.</td>', 'Great pic.  I rated it very high but wish it was a bit sharper.   But on the other hand I figure that you intended it to have a soft look.  Anyway, good work.', '2005-05-19 18:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
