(1399306, 178699, 30817, '<td valign="top">I like the theme of being different.  Believe me, I know that theme VERY well.  That said, I offer some insight to you.  Photos should speak without the need to paste photographer written signs within the frame. If a sign needs to be written and placed in there, that should tip the photographer off that the wrong road is about to be travelled.</td>', 'I like the theme of being different.  Believe me, I know that theme VERY well.  That said, I offer some insight to you.  Photos should speak without the need to paste photographer written signs within the frame. If a sign needs to be written and placed in there, that should tip the photographer off that the wrong road is about to be travelled.', '2005-05-19 20:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399328, 178518, 33736, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  (but, wishing the branch rested on the surface - or a second brach to block the open are)     9</td>', 'Beautiful.  (but, wishing the branch rested on the surface - or a second brach to block the open are)     9', '2005-05-19 20:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
