(1399835, 177973, 19952, '<td valign="top">Absolutely gorgeous colors with outstanding focus and composition. You did a great job with every aspect of this image.</td>', 'Absolutely gorgeous colors with outstanding focus and composition. You did a great job with every aspect of this image.', '2005-05-20 01:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399837, 178973, 19952, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous image with outstanding lighting, focus and composition. Really great job!</td>', 'Gorgeous image with outstanding lighting, focus and composition. Really great job!', '2005-05-20 01:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399842, 179272, 19952, '<td valign="top">I really love the setup in this simple, gorgeous image. Personally, I would like about a full stop more light on this photo to bring out the colors better without quite as much noise. There are also a couple of spots here and there that you might want to clean up. But those points aside, you did an outstanding job composing this shot and the colors work perfectly together to create a beautiful photo. Very nicely done!</td>', 'I really love the setup in this simple, gorgeous image. Personally, I would like about a full stop more light on this photo to bring out the colors better without quite as much noise. There are also a couple of spots here and there that you might want to clean up. But those points aside, you did an outstanding job composing this shot and the colors work perfectly together to create a beautiful photo. Very nicely done!', '2005-05-20 01:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399846, 178345, 19952, '<td valign="top">Very good macro with excellent DOF and sharp focus on the stalk. Really nicely done.</td>', 'Very good macro with excellent DOF and sharp focus on the stalk. Really nicely done.', '2005-05-20 01:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399855, 177507, 37334, '<td valign="top">Cute:)) I think there maybe to many elements competing for attention though? Just the apple and cata..cato...er...insect might have had more impact? But that''s just my opinion;)</td>', 'Cute:)) I think there maybe to many elements competing for attention though? Just the apple and cata..cato...er...insect might have had more impact? But that''s just my opinion;)', '2005-05-20 01:59:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399856, 178651, 19831, '<td valign="top">Great concept. I think it''s a pretty interesting perspective. Cool shot. Really cool lens :-)</td>', 'Great concept. I think it''s a pretty interesting perspective. Cool shot. Really cool lens :-)', '2005-05-20 02:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399858, 179013, 38055, '<td valign="top">Great shot. I love that the thrower of the apple is blurry. Excellent work.</td>', 'Great shot. I love that the thrower of the apple is blurry. Excellent work.', '2005-05-20 02:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399861, 179111, 19831, '<td valign="top">Oh my God, I think I gained 5 pounds just looking at this shot :-)  And I always thought apples were supposed to be good for you?</td>', 'Oh my God, I think I gained 5 pounds just looking at this shot :-)  And I always thought apples were supposed to be good for you?', '2005-05-20 02:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399862, 179083, 38055, '<td valign="top">I like it. I love the contrast the red apples provide against everything else in the picture. Very interesting piece of art.</td>', 'I like it. I love the contrast the red apples provide against everything else in the picture. Very interesting piece of art.', '2005-05-20 02:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399863, 179258, 36235, '<td valign="top">Incredible creativity, and wonderful execution.</td>', 'Incredible creativity, and wonderful execution.', '2005-05-20 02:07:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399866, 177137, 19831, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept. Focus is good and you''ve lit the apple well for this idea. The 3 little lights in the bottom are kind of distracting. I think getting away from the centered composition would work better for this shot. Maybe framing or cropping using the rule of thirds in this case would strengthen the presentation, as well as eliminating the little lights. Another thought, with the title and the concept of this image, perhaps showing a little detail or horizon to add context would make for a stronger photo.</td>', 'Interesting concept. Focus is good and you''ve lit the apple well for this idea. The 3 little lights in the bottom are kind of distracting. I think getting away from the centered composition would work better for this shot. Maybe framing or cropping using the rule of thirds in this case would strengthen the presentation, as well as eliminating the little lights. Another thought, with the title and the concept of this image, perhaps showing a little detail or horizon to add context would make for a stronger photo.', '2005-05-20 02:10:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399875, 179175, 19831, '<td valign="top">Hehehe, love the look on young "Williams" face :-) Using the red shirt is a nice touch, for some reason it just ties in well with the red apple and somehow just ''works''. Skin tone isn''t too bad, but not great either. I wonder if perhaps the shot would be a tad stronger compositionally if the boy were centered on the tree? , but framing the image so that the boy and tree are still offset as you have the boy now, not centered in the photo. (sounds confusing, does that make sense???)</td>', 'Hehehe, love the look on young "Williams" face :-) Using the red shirt is a nice touch, for some reason it just ties in well with the red apple and somehow just ''works''. Skin tone isn''t too bad, but not great either. I wonder if perhaps the shot would be a tad stronger compositionally if the boy were centered on the tree? , but framing the image so that the boy and tree are still offset as you have the boy now, not centered in the photo. (sounds confusing, does that make sense???)', '2005-05-20 02:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1399877, 179272, 27735, '<td valign="top">Love the color, it''s a little noisy, though.</td>', 'Love the color, it''s a little noisy, though.', '2005-05-20 02:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
