(1400506, 177646, 36382, '<td valign="top">I noticed a couple of other similar ideas in the challenge, but this is the most well executed for me.  Great colors.  I really like the shiny tie.  The apple just looks a little strange however as though it was cut and pasted even though I know it wasn''t.  Maybe because it is so far forward from the face.  Overall very well done and I gave 8.</td>', 'I noticed a couple of other similar ideas in the challenge, but this is the most well executed for me.  Great colors.  I really like the shiny tie.  The apple just looks a little strange however as though it was cut and pasted even though I know it wasn''t.  Maybe because it is so far forward from the face.  Overall very well done and I gave 8.', '2005-05-20 12:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
