(1400587, 179013, 27440, '<td valign="top">If only the colours weren''t so washed out....  I love the shot! It''s  very creative.  There are lots of apples in water lots of simple apples but this is something different. I give it initially a 9 but I like this static motion so much that i bump it up. I feel like beeing hit with this apple. This shot makes me feel as if  I was in the shot just about to catch it. Superb :)</td>', 'If only the colours weren''t so washed out....  I love the shot! It''s  very creative.  There are lots of apples in water lots of simple apples but this is something different. I give it initially a 9 but I like this static motion so much that i bump it up. I feel like beeing hit with this apple. This shot makes me feel as if  I was in the shot just about to catch it. Superb :)', '2005-05-20 12:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
