(1401056, 179327, 27845, '<td valign="top">Uh... wat are you trying to say? If I translate this into English I get:<br/>"This is my apple. Yes, I dwell. [It''st] a [green] apple.<br/>(dwell=wohnen -&gt; ich wohne. but "wöhne"?? Ich wöhne mich daran = I''m getting used to it. Also, green = grün, but a green apple = ein grüner Apfel.<br/>I recommend not using internet translators anymore, even more so as the title doesn''t add anything to your image.<br/>4. (not because of the title, but because I don''t like the image that much.)</td>', 'Uh... wat are you trying to say? If I translate this into English I get:"This is my apple. Yes, I dwell. [It''st] a [green] apple.(dwell=wohnen -> ich wohne. but "wöhne"?? Ich wöhne mich daran = I''m getting used to it. Also, green = grün, but a green apple = ein grüner Apfel.I recommend not using internet translators anymore, even more so as the title doesn''t add anything to your image.4. (not because of the title, but because I don''t like the image that much.)', '2005-05-20 16:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
