(1401467, 179334, 34904, '<td valign="top">Something looks goofy with the lighting.  The models hand is real bright, the apple is about right and the background is a bit dark.  I don''t know how you''d do it, but I would like to see the apple brighter and the hand darker.  All in all, not bad photo.</td>', 'Something looks goofy with the lighting.  The models hand is real bright, the apple is about right and the background is a bit dark.  I don''t know how you''d do it, but I would like to see the apple brighter and the hand darker.  All in all, not bad photo.', '2005-05-20 20:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401470, 179004, 13688, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but i would have kept the stemp upwards, so it wasn''t placed so far into the pic.  Would have also worked better for that rule of third thing some people are so concerned about.</td>', 'Good idea, but i would have kept the stemp upwards, so it wasn''t placed so far into the pic.  Would have also worked better for that rule of third thing some people are so concerned about.', '2005-05-20 20:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
