(1401474, 177386, 34904, '<td valign="top">This is too cool.  I can see the reflection of the flash in the center of each apple; I don''t know if that''s the effect you wanted.  The cropping enhances the composition.  I hope this places in the top 20. Bumped it up to an 8.</td>', 'This is too cool.  I can see the reflection of the flash in the center of each apple; I don''t know if that''s the effect you wanted.  The cropping enhances the composition.  I hope this places in the top 20. Bumped it up to an 8.', '2005-05-20 20:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401477, 178005, 34904, '<td valign="top">Not a fan of the arrow through apple on head shots.  There is a slight shadow on the right side of the model.  It would have looked better if you would have done something to diffuse the light flash.  6</td>', 'Not a fan of the arrow through apple on head shots.  There is a slight shadow on the right side of the model.  It would have looked better if you would have done something to diffuse the light flash.  6', '2005-05-20 20:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1401481, 179175, 34904, '<td valign="top">Not a fan of the arrow through the apple on head shots.  Good even exposure.  Smart choice to select a shirt for the model that contrasts with background.  It may have looked better if the tre wasn''t directly behind the model.  6</td>', 'Not a fan of the arrow through the apple on head shots.  Good even exposure.  Smart choice to select a shirt for the model that contrasts with background.  It may have looked better if the tre wasn''t directly behind the model.  6', '2005-05-20 20:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
