(1402108, 179108, 19952, '<td valign="top">Very nice color work on this shot. One of the most unique and interesting photos in this challenge.</td>', 'Very nice color work on this shot. One of the most unique and interesting photos in this challenge.', '2005-05-21 05:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1402110, 178933, 19952, '<td valign="top">You leave your apples out in the rain? ;-) Seriously, this is an excellent photo and a nice use of black and white. The photo seems just a bit over-sharpened, but otherwise it''s a really beautiful image.</td>', 'You leave your apples out in the rain? ;-) Seriously, this is an excellent photo and a nice use of black and white. The photo seems just a bit over-sharpened, but otherwise it''s a really beautiful image.', '2005-05-21 05:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1402120, 179080, 25095, '<td valign="top">I''m sure everyone has commented on the size of your image.  but not sure if anyone has helped you avoid this.  If you have had to make it this small to fint under the mb size limitation try this.  Resize your image to 640x? usually 480, then when you go to save it (depending on your software) check your compression ratio, the more compression the smaller file size BUT the lower the quality also. In Adobe photoshop you can see the file size as you change compression levels so you know which to use.  Some programs will have a save for web function or an optimizer.  Those should help quite a bit.  Good luck.</td>', 'I''m sure everyone has commented on the size of your image.  but not sure if anyone has helped you avoid this.  If you have had to make it this small to fint under the mb size limitation try this.  Resize your image to 640x? usually 480, then when you go to save it (depending on your software) check your compression ratio, the more compression the smaller file size BUT the lower the quality also. In Adobe photoshop you can see the file size as you change compression levels so you know which to use.  Some programs will have a save for web function or an optimizer.  Those should help quite a bit.  Good luck.', '2005-05-21 06:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1402130, 179042, 19952, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot. The composition, detail and rich tones make for an absolutely beautiful image. Very nicely done!</td>', 'I really like this shot. The composition, detail and rich tones make for an absolutely beautiful image. Very nicely done!', '2005-05-21 06:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
