(1403861, 177868, 36604, '<td valign="top">Pity you couldn''t quite get the apple slices on the left to line up as well as the ones on the right.  Nice concept.  The section of power outlet (phone outlet) at the right is distracting, though.</td>', 'Pity you couldn''t quite get the apple slices on the left to line up as well as the ones on the right.  Nice concept.  The section of power outlet (phone outlet) at the right is distracting, though.', '2005-05-22 13:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
