(1403870, 179275, 36604, '<td valign="top">The blown highlights are very distracting, particularly as they are in a central position in the image.  The implementation is good, but the basic idea is somewhat overused.<br/> <br/>Base: 5<br/>Technical: -1<br/>Interest: +1<br/>Emotion: +0<br/>Bias: +0<br/> <br/>Total: 5</td>', 'The blown highlights are very distracting, particularly as they are in a central position in the image.  The implementation is good, but the basic idea is somewhat overused. Base: 5Technical: -1Interest: +1Emotion: +0Bias: +0 Total: 5', '2005-05-22 14:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1403873, 179392, 36604, '<td valign="top">An interesting take on the challenge.  The prominent seed is distracting, though, and mars the star.<br/> <br/>Base: 5<br/>Technical: +0<br/>Interest: +1<br/>Emotion: +0<br/>Bias: +0<br/> <br/>Total: 6</td>', 'An interesting take on the challenge.  The prominent seed is distracting, though, and mars the star. Base: 5Technical: +0Interest: +1Emotion: +0Bias: +0 Total: 6', '2005-05-22 14:04:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1403876, 179074, 36604, '<td valign="top">The reflected glare is very distracting, particularly being so front-and-center, but this is otherwise a fascinating image.  Next time, try putting a screen behind you at an angle and bouncing the flash off of that, or possibly just trying a diffuser.<br/> <br/>Base: +5<br/>Technical: -1<br/>Interest: +2<br/>Emotion: +0<br/>Bias: +0<br/>Total: 6</td>', 'The reflected glare is very distracting, particularly being so front-and-center, but this is otherwise a fascinating image.  Next time, try putting a screen behind you at an angle and bouncing the flash off of that, or possibly just trying a diffuser. Base: +5Technical: -1Interest: +2Emotion: +0Bias: +0Total: 6', '2005-05-22 14:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1403886, 178938, 36914, '<td valign="top">Gives the feel of refreshment, good shot.<br/></td>', 'Gives the feel of refreshment, good shot.', '2005-05-22 14:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1403888, 178127, 36914, '<td valign="top">could be brighter</td>', 'could be brighter', '2005-05-22 14:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1403889, 179039, 36604, '<td valign="top">Blown highlights glare harshly at the right and at the bottom.  Try using spot metering, and underexpose the image (or better, until you get a feel for it, bracket exposures by taking several shots with different settings).<br/> <br/>Not enough draws the eye to the main apple in the center, and the reflected light on it doesn''t help the image.  While the placement of it on a golden point is good basic composition, I might have chosen the lower left instead of the upper left to give more of a sense of "low hanging fruit".  That''s a minor artistic quibble, though, and could go either way.<br/> <br/>I think this is from resizing, but even the central apple looks slightly soft to me.  Try running a very, very slight resharpening on the image after resizing to compensate.<br/> <br/>Base: 5<br/>Technical: -2<br/>Interest: -1<br/>Emotion: +0<br/>Bias: +0<br/> <br/>Total: 2<br/> <br/>Don''t be too disheartened by the low score.  If you keep practicing, it doesn''t take very long before the technical errors stop happening, then you just get stuck around 5 for a while while you figure out what  kind of subjects the DPC crowd actually likes. :)</td>', 'Blown highlights glare harshly at the right and at the bottom.  Try using spot metering, and underexpose the image (or better, until you get a feel for it, bracket exposures by taking several shots with different settings). Not enough draws the eye to the main apple in the center, and the reflected light on it doesn''t help the image.  While the placement of it on a golden point is good basic composition, I might have chosen the lower left instead of the upper left to give more of a sense of "low hanging fruit".  That''s a minor artistic quibble, though, and could go either way. I think this is from resizing, but even the central apple looks slightly soft to me.  Try running a very, very slight resharpening on the image after resizing to compensate. Base: 5Technical: -2Interest: -1Emotion: +0Bias: +0 Total: 2 Don''t be too disheartened by the low score.  If you keep practicing, it doesn''t take very long before the technical errors stop happening, then you just get stuck around 5 for a while while you figure out what  kind of subjects the DPC crowd actually likes. :)', '2005-05-22 14:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1403891, 178969, 36914, '<td valign="top">The bright white is a little destracting</td>', 'The bright white is a little destracting', '2005-05-22 14:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1403894, 178133, 29009, '<td valign="top">Good composition and color, good use of DOF.  Perhaps a different background would have made the apple pop more.  Overall, a good shot.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Good composition and color, good use of DOF.  Perhaps a different background would have made the apple pop more.  Overall, a good shot.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-05-22 14:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1403896, 178233, 36604, '<td valign="top">Image is out of focus, seems slightly posterized, and has dark shadows that drop off too severely into black.  The reflected highlight on the knife is also very harsh, and seems blown.  The colors on the blade are somewhat pretty, but the colors on the handle are very odd, and the green at the left looks like fungus.  Try a different angle to avoid the reflection, which is causing the extreme dynamic range hurting this image in both directions.  If the title had been about the reflected light, drawing the interest to the colors, the image might have been more interesting, but as it is, it isn''t really memorable, and the light just looks like an artifact of the reflection error.  An apple and a knife on a counter alone isn''t a very interesting image.<br/> <br/>Base: 5<br/>Technical: -2<br/>Interest: -1<br/>Emotion: +0<br/>Bias: +0<br/> <br/>Total: 2<br/></td>', 'Image is out of focus, seems slightly posterized, and has dark shadows that drop off too severely into black.  The reflected highlight on the knife is also very harsh, and seems blown.  The colors on the blade are somewhat pretty, but the colors on the handle are very odd, and the green at the left looks like fungus.  Try a different angle to avoid the reflection, which is causing the extreme dynamic range hurting this image in both directions.  If the title had been about the reflected light, drawing the interest to the colors, the image might have been more interesting, but as it is, it isn''t really memorable, and the light just looks like an artifact of the reflection error.  An apple and a knife on a counter alone isn''t a very interesting image. Base: 5Technical: -2Interest: -1Emotion: +0Bias: +0 Total: 2', '2005-05-22 14:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
