(1403907, 176965, 36604, '<td valign="top">Laughter gets you a bonus point.  The bright blue table seems a little harsh, though, (try dark green instead?) and the apple seems slightly out of focus, like you focused on the board and didn''t have enough range to reach it.  Try tripod-mounting, and shooting at a higher aperture (f/11 should probably do it).<br/> <br/>Base: +5<br/>Technical: -1<br/>Interest: +1<br/>Emotion: +1<br/>Bias: +0<br/> <br/>Total: 6</td>', 'Laughter gets you a bonus point.  The bright blue table seems a little harsh, though, (try dark green instead?) and the apple seems slightly out of focus, like you focused on the board and didn''t have enough range to reach it.  Try tripod-mounting, and shooting at a higher aperture (f/11 should probably do it). Base: +5Technical: -1Interest: +1Emotion: +1Bias: +0 Total: 6', '2005-05-22 14:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1403909, 178930, 29009, '<td valign="top">This image has a documentary feel rather than giving the viewer a glimpse of creative inspiration.  The fold in the newspaper detracts from the image.  Personally, I''d rather see the photographer''s attempt at something similar rather than just a picture of someone else''s picture.</td>', 'This image has a documentary feel rather than giving the viewer a glimpse of creative inspiration.  The fold in the newspaper detracts from the image.  Personally, I''d rather see the photographer''s attempt at something similar rather than just a picture of someone else''s picture.', '2005-05-22 14:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1403916, 179290, 29009, '<td valign="top">This is amusement appeal.  This shot would have benefited from a less cluttered background.  Additionally, if the apple had been entirely red against the green grass or a blue sky, that would have worked better as well.  Instead of a stick in the ground, you might have used a flowering shrub or at least something with leaves to add believability.  This was a very creative idea.</td>', 'This is amusement appeal.  This shot would have benefited from a less cluttered background.  Additionally, if the apple had been entirely red against the green grass or a blue sky, that would have worked better as well.  Instead of a stick in the ground, you might have used a flowering shrub or at least something with leaves to add believability.  This was a very creative idea.', '2005-05-22 14:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1403917, 177767, 36604, '<td valign="top">Interesting arrangement and lighting.  I''m very curious to find out how you got an apple logo where it is, particularly transparent, flat, and upside down relative to the wineglass (a stained glass decoration, selectively desaturated?).  A technical perfection bonus is marred by the harsh reflected light on the apple (very difficult to avoid, though).<br/> <br/>Base: 5<br/>Technical: +0<br/>Interest: +2<br/>Emotion: +0<br/>Bias: +0<br/> <br/>Total: 7<br/></td>', 'Interesting arrangement and lighting.  I''m very curious to find out how you got an apple logo where it is, particularly transparent, flat, and upside down relative to the wineglass (a stained glass decoration, selectively desaturated?).  A technical perfection bonus is marred by the harsh reflected light on the apple (very difficult to avoid, though). Base: 5Technical: +0Interest: +2Emotion: +0Bias: +0 Total: 7', '2005-05-22 14:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
