(1403922, 177635, 36914, '<td valign="top">I had to do a double take I was looking for the other leg, only to find that they are setting on a refletive surface.  Nice concept and good thought .</td>', 'I had to do a double take I was looking for the other leg, only to find that they are setting on a refletive surface.  Nice concept and good thought .', '2005-05-22 14:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1403923, 179367, 36604, '<td valign="top">With the thin orange slices, you missed a "grate" pun, that would have gotten you a bonus point from me, and probably negative points from everyone else. :)<br/> <br/>Good use of basic colors, and the angle, which frequently bothers me in other shots, works well here.  Reflections mar the scene somewhat (try a polarizer?).<br/> <br/>Base: +5<br/>Technical: +0<br/>Interest: +1<br/>Emotion: +0<br/>Bias: +0<br/> <br/>Total: 6<br/></td>', 'With the thin orange slices, you missed a "grate" pun, that would have gotten you a bonus point from me, and probably negative points from everyone else. :) Good use of basic colors, and the angle, which frequently bothers me in other shots, works well here.  Reflections mar the scene somewhat (try a polarizer?). Base: +5Technical: +0Interest: +1Emotion: +0Bias: +0 Total: 6', '2005-05-22 14:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1403928, 179167, 29009, '<td valign="top">Good use of DOF here.  Unfortunately, the lines on the calendar days are leading the eyes to the blurry background rather than the focal point.  Also, you might have considered cropping out the bottom of the calendar in the lower right corner.  Lastly, the apple with the bite out of it has noticable spots and doesn''t look as yummy as some of the ones in the background.  This was a very creative idea and was well-titled.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Good use of DOF here.  Unfortunately, the lines on the calendar days are leading the eyes to the blurry background rather than the focal point.  Also, you might have considered cropping out the bottom of the calendar in the lower right corner.  Lastly, the apple with the bite out of it has noticable spots and doesn''t look as yummy as some of the ones in the background.  This was a very creative idea and was well-titled.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-05-22 14:37:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1403929, 179150, 36604, '<td valign="top">A very smooth meld, much better than many.  Sharpness is good.  The brightness of the wood is very harsh, however, and distracts from the image.  Try shadow/highlight correction to darken just that, and mute the reflection at the top of the apple somewhat.<br/> <br/>Base: 5<br/>Technical: +0<br/>Interest: +1<br/>Emotion: +0<br/>Bias: +0<br/> <br/>Total: 6</td>', 'A very smooth meld, much better than many.  Sharpness is good.  The brightness of the wood is very harsh, however, and distracts from the image.  Try shadow/highlight correction to darken just that, and mute the reflection at the top of the apple somewhat. Base: 5Technical: +0Interest: +1Emotion: +0Bias: +0 Total: 6', '2005-05-22 14:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
