(1403974, 178845, 29009, '<td valign="top">Now this is the coolest idea ever.  I might have cropped out whatever is in the lower left corner, and I wish this had better focus and white balance.  Lastly, the background reflected in the mirror is cluttered.  But don''t take all that as negative, because I''d love to see this re-shot with the mirror reflecting a black background and some different lighting.  Hmm, I''m still looking at this shot because I''m trying to figure out how it was done.  Well, you''ve inspired me.  I can''t give it a super score because of the technical details, but I really liked it!</td>', 'Now this is the coolest idea ever.  I might have cropped out whatever is in the lower left corner, and I wish this had better focus and white balance.  Lastly, the background reflected in the mirror is cluttered.  But don''t take all that as negative, because I''d love to see this re-shot with the mirror reflecting a black background and some different lighting.  Hmm, I''m still looking at this shot because I''m trying to figure out how it was done.  Well, you''ve inspired me.  I can''t give it a super score because of the technical details, but I really liked it!', '2005-05-22 14:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1403977, 179374, 29009, '<td valign="top">This is one of those shots where I say to myself, "Now why didn''t I think of that?"  Good job!  This presents an unusual point of view, is technically excellent, and I wish you the best of luck in the challenge.  I''m adding it to my favorites!</td>', 'This is one of those shots where I say to myself, "Now why didn''t I think of that?"  Good job!  This presents an unusual point of view, is technically excellent, and I wish you the best of luck in the challenge.  I''m adding it to my favorites!', '2005-05-22 14:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
