(1403981, 179272, 29009, '<td valign="top">Simple and elegant.  It strikes me that the bowl is probably supposed to be white and therefore the color balance is off, or maybe I''m just wishing for a white bowl to help separate the apple from the background.  Either way - overall this is a great shot.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Simple and elegant.  It strikes me that the bowl is probably supposed to be white and therefore the color balance is off, or maybe I''m just wishing for a white bowl to help separate the apple from the background.  Either way - overall this is a great shot.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-05-22 15:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1403982, 179005, 36604, '<td valign="top">I assume that there''s an apple somewhere at the bottom that''s providing the red coloration.  This is an interesting shot to score, because it''s got technical merit, and the color and splash effect add interest, but I think it kind of misses the point of the challenge (I wanted to see a *visible* apple somewhere, and all I see here is splash and red), making it the first one so far to score less than 5 base points.<br/> <br/>Base: 3<br/>Technical +2<br/>Interest: +1<br/>Emotion: +0<br/>Bias: +0<br/> <br/>Total: 4</td>', 'I assume that there''s an apple somewhere at the bottom that''s providing the red coloration.  This is an interesting shot to score, because it''s got technical merit, and the color and splash effect add interest, but I think it kind of misses the point of the challenge (I wanted to see a *visible* apple somewhere, and all I see here is splash and red), making it the first one so far to score less than 5 base points. Base: 3Technical +2Interest: +1Emotion: +0Bias: +0 Total: 4', '2005-05-22 15:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1403985, 178026, 36604, '<td valign="top">The cherries as children was cute, and made me smile, but the scene seems slightly out of focus, and the reflections are a little harsh.  I also have a personal thing against bright white backgrounds, since they hurt my eyes.  Other voters don''t seem to have a problem with it, but I score down slightly shots that hurt me.<br/> <br/>Base: 5<br/>Technical: -1<br/>Interest: +1<br/>Emotion: +1<br/>Bias: -1<br/> <br/>Total: 5</td>', 'The cherries as children was cute, and made me smile, but the scene seems slightly out of focus, and the reflections are a little harsh.  I also have a personal thing against bright white backgrounds, since they hurt my eyes.  Other voters don''t seem to have a problem with it, but I score down slightly shots that hurt me. Base: 5Technical: -1Interest: +1Emotion: +1Bias: -1 Total: 5', '2005-05-22 15:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1403986, 177984, 37116, '<td valign="top">I have no idea how you set this up, but it''s a great image--It''s so clear and I can almost hear the bubbles</td>', 'I have no idea how you set this up, but it''s a great image--It''s so clear and I can almost hear the bubbles', '2005-05-22 15:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1403987, 177635, 36604, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Just... wow.  How long did it take you to do this?  The slightly lighter reflective surface they sit on actually does look something like a smooth pond at night, and the effect is both peaceful and amusing.<br/> <br/>Base: 5<br/>Technical: +1<br/>Interest: +2<br/>Emotion: +1<br/>Bias: +1<br/> <br/>Total: 10<br/> <br/>Best of challenge so far.</td>', 'Wow.  Just... wow.  How long did it take you to do this?  The slightly lighter reflective surface they sit on actually does look something like a smooth pond at night, and the effect is both peaceful and amusing. Base: 5Technical: +1Interest: +2Emotion: +1Bias: +1 Total: 10 Best of challenge so far.', '2005-05-22 15:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1403989, 179331, 36604, '<td valign="top">This looks like she went bobbing and then was suddenly frozen solid.  I''m not sure that''s the effect you were going for, but it''s definitely viscerally disturbing to me, which gets a bonus point.<br/> <br/>Base: 5<br/>Technical +0<br/>Interest: +2<br/>Emotion: +1<br/>Bias: +0<br/> <br/>Total: 8</td>', 'This looks like she went bobbing and then was suddenly frozen solid.  I''m not sure that''s the effect you were going for, but it''s definitely viscerally disturbing to me, which gets a bonus point. Base: 5Technical +0Interest: +2Emotion: +1Bias: +0 Total: 8', '2005-05-22 15:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1403993, 179111, 36604, '<td valign="top">You get a point of interest for having a picture without an apple actually visible where the apple is sufficiently implied that there''s no question it meets the challenge.  Interesting textures, and you''re making me crave sweets.  Picture isn''t quite as sharp as I would have liked, but is (barely) passable.<br/> <br/>Base: 5<br/>Technical: +0<br/>Interest: +2<br/>Emotion: +0<br/>Bias: +0<br/> <br/>Total: 7</td>', 'You get a point of interest for having a picture without an apple actually visible where the apple is sufficiently implied that there''s no question it meets the challenge.  Interesting textures, and you''re making me crave sweets.  Picture isn''t quite as sharp as I would have liked, but is (barely) passable. Base: 5Technical: +0Interest: +2Emotion: +0Bias: +0 Total: 7', '2005-05-22 15:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1403996, 178749, 36604, '<td valign="top">The image is soft, the background is a harsh white that hurts my eyes, the title misspelled, and the placement of random sex appeal triggers my cynical nature and loses my interest.  The pins in the apple are distracting.<br/> <br/>Base: 5<br/>Technical: -1<br/>Interest: -1<br/>Emotion: +0<br/>Bias: -1<br/> <br/>Total: 2</td>', 'The image is soft, the background is a harsh white that hurts my eyes, the title misspelled, and the placement of random sex appeal triggers my cynical nature and loses my interest.  The pins in the apple are distracting. Base: 5Technical: -1Interest: -1Emotion: +0Bias: -1 Total: 2', '2005-05-22 15:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1403997, 178871, 36604, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for a good literary allusion.  Image seems very slightly soft, perhaps from resizing (it helps to very slightly resharpen after the resize).<br/> <br/>Base: 5<br/>Technical: +0<br/>Interest: +2<br/>Emotion: +0<br/>Bias: +0<br/> <br/>Total: 7</td>', 'I''m a sucker for a good literary allusion.  Image seems very slightly soft, perhaps from resizing (it helps to very slightly resharpen after the resize). Base: 5Technical: +0Interest: +2Emotion: +0Bias: +0 Total: 7', '2005-05-22 15:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404000, 177967, 36604, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what that thing is, but the expression is amusing.  The colors seem very badly off, there''s fringing at the edges of contours, and some kind of grass appears to have floated up in front of the image, which is very distracting.  The focus also appears to be in an odd place (the fur on the head, and the aperture isn''t small enough to carry it forward to the apple and hands.<br/> <br/>Base: 5<br/>Technical: -2<br/>Interest: +1<br/>Emotion: +0<br/>Bias: +0<br/> <br/>Total: 4</td>', 'I''m not sure what that thing is, but the expression is amusing.  The colors seem very badly off, there''s fringing at the edges of contours, and some kind of grass appears to have floated up in front of the image, which is very distracting.  The focus also appears to be in an odd place (the fur on the head, and the aperture isn''t small enough to carry it forward to the apple and hands. Base: 5Technical: -2Interest: +1Emotion: +0Bias: +0 Total: 4', '2005-05-22 15:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404001, 179108, 36604, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Now that''s some severe color manipulation.  The effect is very striking, however.  I wish the stem had been a little sharper, but the overall effect isn''t bad.  Bright white backgrounds hurt my eyes, however, and cost you a personal point.<br/> <br/>Base: 5<br/>Technical: +0<br/>Interest: +2<br/>Emotion: +0<br/>Bias: -1<br/> <br/>Total: 6</td>', 'Wow.  Now that''s some severe color manipulation.  The effect is very striking, however.  I wish the stem had been a little sharper, but the overall effect isn''t bad.  Bright white backgrounds hurt my eyes, however, and cost you a personal point. Base: 5Technical: +0Interest: +2Emotion: +0Bias: -1 Total: 6', '2005-05-22 15:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404002, 179202, 29009, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I don''t care for your title.  It seems a little too politically charged, and I''m not sure the scene depicted supports it.  This shot used DOF well.  There is a hot spot on the apple that is distracting.  The background is cluttered and visually uninteresting.  The facial expressions are not attractive - the figure in black doesn''t have a friendly expression, and the little girl doesn''t look like she really wants the apple.  There is a distracting element in the lower left hand corner of the frame that I might have cropped out.  With regard to composition, the apple is dead-on center which forces the head of the older person to be cut off.  You might have tried to frame the shot using the rule of thirds.  Now this is just me, but this would have been an awesome shot if you had framed just the hands of the two people exchanging the apple with the sky as a background.   Same position of the older person''s hand, with the little girl reaching up for it.</td>', 'Sorry, I don''t care for your title.  It seems a little too politically charged, and I''m not sure the scene depicted supports it.  This shot used DOF well.  There is a hot spot on the apple that is distracting.  The background is cluttered and visually uninteresting.  The facial expressions are not attractive - the figure in black doesn''t have a friendly expression, and the little girl doesn''t look like she really wants the apple.  There is a distracting element in the lower left hand corner of the frame that I might have cropped out.  With regard to composition, the apple is dead-on center which forces the head of the older person to be cut off.  You might have tried to frame the shot using the rule of thirds.  Now this is just me, but this would have been an awesome shot if you had framed just the hands of the two people exchanging the apple with the sky as a background.   Same position of the older person''s hand, with the little girl reaching up for it.', '2005-05-22 15:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404006, 177140, 29009, '<td valign="top">Oh, now this is just fantastic.  I love the lipstick kiss on the apple - just fabulous.  Great title!  My one small nit is the lighting - the right side of the mannequin is getting somewhat lost in the background.  Nonetheless, this is an awesome shot that should do very well in the challenge.  Good luck!</td>', 'Oh, now this is just fantastic.  I love the lipstick kiss on the apple - just fabulous.  Great title!  My one small nit is the lighting - the right side of the mannequin is getting somewhat lost in the background.  Nonetheless, this is an awesome shot that should do very well in the challenge.  Good luck!', '2005-05-22 15:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404008, 177452, 36604, '<td valign="top">An interesting take on the competition scores you bonus points from me, and just *barely* manages to stay within what I consider the topic limits.  The image is sharp, and the colors are nice.  The scene evokes a vague sense of peaceful wonder at the beginning of new growth.<br/> <br/>Base: 5<br/>Technical: +0<br/>Interest: +2<br/>Emotion: +1<br/>Bias: +0<br/> <br/>Total: 8</td>', 'An interesting take on the competition scores you bonus points from me, and just *barely* manages to stay within what I consider the topic limits.  The image is sharp, and the colors are nice.  The scene evokes a vague sense of peaceful wonder at the beginning of new growth. Base: 5Technical: +0Interest: +2Emotion: +1Bias: +0 Total: 8', '2005-05-22 15:21:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404015, 176816, 29009, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition and colors.  This is great!  Really made me smile - good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Excellent composition and colors.  This is great!  Really made me smile - good luck in the challenge.', '2005-05-22 15:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404016, 178651, 36604, '<td valign="top">What, get a blurry shot?   That doesn''t look remotely like a macro lens to me.  Although that thought keeps sticking in my head, the image is sharp, the background texture interesting, and the setup vaguely amusing.<br/> <br/>But I can''t get over the fact that it doesn''t look remotely like a macro lens, and the dark shade in front makes it look like the photographer in the picture has even forgotten to take the lens cap off.<br/> <br/>Base: 5<br/>Technical: +0<br/>Interest: +1<br/>Emotion: +1<br/>Bias: -1<br/> <br/>Total: 6</td>', 'What, get a blurry shot?   That doesn''t look remotely like a macro lens to me.  Although that thought keeps sticking in my head, the image is sharp, the background texture interesting, and the setup vaguely amusing. But I can''t get over the fact that it doesn''t look remotely like a macro lens, and the dark shade in front makes it look like the photographer in the picture has even forgotten to take the lens cap off. Base: 5Technical: +0Interest: +1Emotion: +1Bias: -1 Total: 6', '2005-05-22 15:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1404017, 177512, 36604, '<td valign="top">The sudden context shift here draws the eye and gets a smile from me.  I wish that the entire castle was sharply in focus (the eye being drawn solely by color), or that the scene was set so that the apple was at a golden point, rather than in the far corner, and the depth of field set much *narrower*, so that the castle was more heavily blurred.<br/> <br/>Base: 5<br/>Technical: +0<br/>Interest: +1<br/>Emotion: +0<br/>Bias: +0<br/> <br/>Total: 6</td>', 'The sudden context shift here draws the eye and gets a smile from me.  I wish that the entire castle was sharply in focus (the eye being drawn solely by color), or that the scene was set so that the apple was at a golden point, rather than in the far corner, and the depth of field set much *narrower*, so that the castle was more heavily blurred. Base: 5Technical: +0Interest: +1Emotion: +0Bias: +0 Total: 6', '2005-05-22 15:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
