(1404773, 179365, 36920, '<td valign="top">awesome composition and i love how the apple is illuminated.   great background of the setting sun and the color contrast with the white.   the lighting is key and you did a wonderful job.!!!</td>', 'awesome composition and i love how the apple is illuminated.   great background of the setting sun and the color contrast with the white.   the lighting is key and you did a wonderful job.!!!', '2005-05-23 00:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
