(1407201, 178934, 29009, '<td valign="top">Returning for comment.  Good use of DOF, composition is correct for the elements at hand.  Perhaps having the eyes of the animal would have helped overall impact.  Congratulate on the minimum of animal drool.  Colors seem a bit flat.  Your''e on the road here with good use of techniques, but overall the shot is somewhat mundane when compared with others in the challenge.</td>', 'Returning for comment.  Good use of DOF, composition is correct for the elements at hand.  Perhaps having the eyes of the animal would have helped overall impact.  Congratulate on the minimum of animal drool.  Colors seem a bit flat.  Your''e on the road here with good use of techniques, but overall the shot is somewhat mundane when compared with others in the challenge.', '2005-05-23 20:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1407209, 178848, 29009, '<td valign="top">Returning for comment.  Soft focus and monochromatic color isn''t helping this image.  With regard to composition, the apple is in the right part of the frame.  This image is not as strong as others in the challenge - keep trying and I''m sure the next one will do better.</td>', 'Returning for comment.  Soft focus and monochromatic color isn''t helping this image.  With regard to composition, the apple is in the right part of the frame.  This image is not as strong as others in the challenge - keep trying and I''m sure the next one will do better.', '2005-05-23 21:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1407275, 177615, 29009, '<td valign="top">Returning for comment.  You''ve got a beautiful and yummy looking apple next to a thoroughly gross animal mouth.  The tooth decay and drool are kind of ruining the overall visual appeal, at least for me.  On the plus side, this shot shows an effective use of DOF.</td>', 'Returning for comment.  You''ve got a beautiful and yummy looking apple next to a thoroughly gross animal mouth.  The tooth decay and drool are kind of ruining the overall visual appeal, at least for me.  On the plus side, this shot shows an effective use of DOF.', '2005-05-23 21:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
