(1408045, 178528, 29009, '<td valign="top">This was a very creative idea!  My one small nit is the position of the fingers on the applicator.  Because the red of the fingernails appears to be the exact same color as the red applied to the apple, one of the nail tips is getting lost in the applicator brush.  Overall, a stongly composed well-done shot!</td>', 'This was a very creative idea!  My one small nit is the position of the fingers on the applicator.  Because the red of the fingernails appears to be the exact same color as the red applied to the apple, one of the nail tips is getting lost in the applicator brush.  Overall, a stongly composed well-done shot!', '2005-05-24 09:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408046, 177635, 29154, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful .... the photo itself and also the art work performed with those apples.</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful .... the photo itself and also the art work performed with those apples.', '2005-05-24 09:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408052, 177868, 29009, '<td valign="top">Can tell you spent time setting up this shot.  A solid color background would have improved it, I think.  Right now you can see a portion of an electrical outlet in the middle right side.  It looks like you tried to crop it out as much as you could, but it''s leaving unbalanced space on the left side of the left-most apple.  The table pattern is a bit distracting, and there appears to be a loose stem hanging around next to the apple on the right.   Point of view is good.  You are on the right track here, but when compared to other shots in the challenge this one is not quite as strong.  Overall, a decent shot.</td>', 'Can tell you spent time setting up this shot.  A solid color background would have improved it, I think.  Right now you can see a portion of an electrical outlet in the middle right side.  It looks like you tried to crop it out as much as you could, but it''s leaving unbalanced space on the left side of the left-most apple.  The table pattern is a bit distracting, and there appears to be a loose stem hanging around next to the apple on the right.   Point of view is good.  You are on the right track here, but when compared to other shots in the challenge this one is not quite as strong.  Overall, a decent shot.', '2005-05-24 09:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
