(1408440, 179272, 3669, '<td valign="top">Great photo.  I like the greens.  Nice focus.  Just two things.  Maybe a tad bit tighter crop on the right....and it is a little too dark for my liking.  =9</td>', 'Great photo.  I like the greens.  Nice focus.  Just two things.  Maybe a tad bit tighter crop on the right....and it is a little too dark for my liking.  =9', '2005-05-24 13:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408445, 179174, 3669, '<td valign="top">I scored this one a 10 because (1) it obviously meets the challenge with great focus on the subject, (2) I like the lighting, (3) I like the color and motion blurr of the water.  You picked up hints of pastels. Bonus:  I like how you caught the water drops on the side of the apple.</td>', 'I scored this one a 10 because (1) it obviously meets the challenge with great focus on the subject, (2) I like the lighting, (3) I like the color and motion blurr of the water.  You picked up hints of pastels. Bonus:  I like how you caught the water drops on the side of the apple.', '2005-05-24 13:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408452, 178938, 3669, '<td valign="top">This is a nice and refreashing photo.  I love the colors and the lighting is perfect.  i would love to have a drink of that water.  Good job   10</td>', 'This is a nice and refreashing photo.  I love the colors and the lighting is perfect.  i would love to have a drink of that water.  Good job   10', '2005-05-24 13:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408455, 179309, 3669, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture.  The lighting is perfect.  The only thing I don''t like is the background at the bottom.  However, the apple is portrayed well in this creative and well done photo.  10</td>', 'Very nice picture.  The lighting is perfect.  The only thing I don''t like is the background at the bottom.  However, the apple is portrayed well in this creative and well done photo.  10', '2005-05-24 13:32:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408465, 178392, 3669, '<td valign="top">The apple just seems to be a little out of place in this picture.  Maybe I''ve been studying pictures too long today, however, the apple was obviously placed there as it looks like an apple from the store (uniformly green and nicely waxed), whereas the leaf looks natural in this worn window seal or box.  Otherwise the color and focus are nice and well done.  =9</td>', 'The apple just seems to be a little out of place in this picture.  Maybe I''ve been studying pictures too long today, however, the apple was obviously placed there as it looks like an apple from the store (uniformly green and nicely waxed), whereas the leaf looks natural in this worn window seal or box.  Otherwise the color and focus are nice and well done.  =9', '2005-05-24 13:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408475, 178870, 3669, '<td valign="top">I''m not like most voters on DPC.  I''m a sucker for good pet photos.  I very much praise your dog for being such a good model.  Poor guy, I hope his/her eyes didn''t get stuck cross eyed during this photo shoot.  LOL  The dog definately steels the show from the subject of the challenge, but I don''t care.  The lighting helps draw it out better.  A little dark at the bottom.  I may have cropped off more at the bottom rather than trying to lighten the whole picture.  10 regardless</td>', 'I''m not like most voters on DPC.  I''m a sucker for good pet photos.  I very much praise your dog for being such a good model.  Poor guy, I hope his/her eyes didn''t get stuck cross eyed during this photo shoot.  LOL  The dog definately steels the show from the subject of the challenge, but I don''t care.  The lighting helps draw it out better.  A little dark at the bottom.  I may have cropped off more at the bottom rather than trying to lighten the whole picture.  10 regardless', '2005-05-24 13:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408479, 179113, 3669, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this picture, however, this looks a little over processed.  Too much soft focus on the apple.  Did you use Neat Image?  If you did, the apple suffered. Otherwise the lighting looks good and the colors are crisp.  8</td>', 'I like the composition of this picture, however, this looks a little over processed.  Too much soft focus on the apple.  Did you use Neat Image?  If you did, the apple suffered. Otherwise the lighting looks good and the colors are crisp.  8', '2005-05-24 13:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408483, 179341, 3669, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and lighting.  However, the focus is the bummer...just a little too soft on the subject for my liking.</td>', 'Nice colors and lighting.  However, the focus is the bummer...just a little too soft on the subject for my liking.', '2005-05-24 13:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408486, 179374, 38161, '<td valign="top">Makes me think of something better ! Nice Job !</td>', 'Makes me think of something better ! Nice Job !', '2005-05-24 13:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408488, 179013, 3669, '<td valign="top">Origonal and nicely done.  Great focus and placement of the apple in flight.  I would have liked to see this with some color...even if it was just sutle by not completly desaturating it.  9</td>', 'Origonal and nicely done.  Great focus and placement of the apple in flight.  I would have liked to see this with some color...even if it was just sutle by not completly desaturating it.  9', '2005-05-24 13:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408498, 178516, 3669, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  Looks very country.  The color in the apples seem to be a little over saturated...could be just me or my monitor.  However, I feel that desaturating them a little would make them look more natural.  Also, the focus is a little soft.  8</td>', 'Nice composition.  Looks very country.  The color in the apples seem to be a little over saturated...could be just me or my monitor.  However, I feel that desaturating them a little would make them look more natural.  Also, the focus is a little soft.  8', '2005-05-24 13:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408504, 178973, 3669, '<td valign="top">Lighting perfect, subject is crisp a clean, color is nice.  The leaf on the apple seems a little unnatural to me (not close enough to the stem), but that could just be the camera angle.  I still score it a 10</td>', 'Lighting perfect, subject is crisp a clean, color is nice.  The leaf on the apple seems a little unnatural to me (not close enough to the stem), but that could just be the camera angle.  I still score it a 10', '2005-05-24 14:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408507, 178933, 3669, '<td valign="top">Nice focus.  I would have liked to see this in color.  A bit grainy.</td>', 'Nice focus.  I would have liked to see this in color.  A bit grainy.', '2005-05-24 14:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408510, 179059, 3669, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition.  Apple, the main subject for the challenge is a little too dark and soft in focus.</td>', 'Interesting composition.  Apple, the main subject for the challenge is a little too dark and soft in focus.', '2005-05-24 14:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408512, 178131, 3669, '<td valign="top">Great capture!!  Although the sky appears a little overcast in the background, the lighting is perfect on the bird.  Good cropping...fits perfect in the picture.  One of my favorites in this challenge.  Good job!!  10</td>', 'Great capture!!  Although the sky appears a little overcast in the background, the lighting is perfect on the bird.  Good cropping...fits perfect in the picture.  One of my favorites in this challenge.  Good job!!  10', '2005-05-24 14:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408518, 179366, 3669, '<td valign="top">Nice and subtle.  Perhaps the color in the apple is a little too oversaturated.  It just doesn''t look quite natural to me.</td>', 'Nice and subtle.  Perhaps the color in the apple is a little too oversaturated.  It just doesn''t look quite natural to me.', '2005-05-24 14:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408523, 177390, 3669, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and lighting.  Maybe just a tad over sharpened in my opinion. 9</td>', 'Nice composition and lighting.  Maybe just a tad over sharpened in my opinion. 9', '2005-05-24 14:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408527, 179294, 3669, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  I love the colors!!  I don''t quite understand the title, but scores a 10 in my book anyway</td>', 'Nice photo.  I love the colors!!  I don''t quite understand the title, but scores a 10 in my book anyway', '2005-05-24 14:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408545, 178044, 3669, '<td valign="top">Beautiful puppy.  Siberian Huskies are one of my favorite breeds of dog.  I don''t know if it was your intention, but the photo seems a little overprocessed and in soft focus.   It looks to me like you bumped up the red to bring out the apples, but it also put red in the puppy''s coat.  Desaturating would take the pink out of the coat and make the apples look more natural while not taking away from those beautiful eyes.  My two cents  :-)</td>', 'Beautiful puppy.  Siberian Huskies are one of my favorite breeds of dog.  I don''t know if it was your intention, but the photo seems a little overprocessed and in soft focus.   It looks to me like you bumped up the red to bring out the apples, but it also put red in the puppy''s coat.  Desaturating would take the pink out of the coat and make the apples look more natural while not taking away from those beautiful eyes.  My two cents  :-)', '2005-05-24 14:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408607, 179120, 10124, '<td valign="top">best photo in the challenge.</td>', 'best photo in the challenge.', '2005-05-24 15:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408622, 177646, 35804, '<td valign="top">This needed to be validated? ( I think that''s some string/monofilament I see coming from that apple? Not bothersome though. ) Hmmm...The best Magritte homage..nice light, nice clear colors esp. that red tie...maybe a little too much sharpness ? I''m not sure...but very nicely done indeed....that red tie is scrumptous.</td>', 'This needed to be validated? ( I think that''s some string/monofilament I see coming from that apple? Not bothersome though. ) Hmmm...The best Magritte homage..nice light, nice clear colors esp. that red tie...maybe a little too much sharpness ? I''m not sure...but very nicely done indeed....that red tie is scrumptous.', '2005-05-24 15:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408624, 179389, 35804, '<td valign="top">What a creative use of light! This is a really fun image, beautiful warm light...just really nicely done.</td>', 'What a creative use of light! This is a really fun image, beautiful warm light...just really nicely done.', '2005-05-24 15:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408632, 178498, 35804, '<td valign="top">A really nice candid shot...a warm and friendly face,  no doubt about it...nice composition, lovely color.</td>', 'A really nice candid shot...a warm and friendly face,  no doubt about it...nice composition, lovely color.', '2005-05-24 15:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408637, 178870, 35804, '<td valign="top">This is great...a well trained dog indeed! This image makes me smile...well done!</td>', 'This is great...a well trained dog indeed! This image makes me smile...well done!', '2005-05-24 15:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408639, 177473, 33379, '<td valign="top">that is so funny, i would love to do this to our pug!! oh yeh nice apple!</td>', 'that is so funny, i would love to do this to our pug!! oh yeh nice apple!', '2005-05-24 15:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408643, 179274, 35804, '<td valign="top">Kinda gross but beautiful at the same time...that juicy core looks somewhat "meaty" to me...almost like chicken bone...I must be strange, anyway, interesting image, nice light and texture.</td>', 'Kinda gross but beautiful at the same time...that juicy core looks somewhat "meaty" to me...almost like chicken bone...I must be strange, anyway, interesting image, nice light and texture.', '2005-05-24 15:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408657, 179013, 35804, '<td valign="top">This is a really cool image...I think it needs a bit more contrast...I don''t see any real blacks...and the greenish sepia is a little odd..but then again the image reminds me of an old faded photo...regardless...this is a standout amongst a bunch of ordinary apples.</td>', 'This is a really cool image...I think it needs a bit more contrast...I don''t see any real blacks...and the greenish sepia is a little odd..but then again the image reminds me of an old faded photo...regardless...this is a standout amongst a bunch of ordinary apples.', '2005-05-24 15:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408663, 179170, 35804, '<td valign="top">CRUNCH! .....Totally against the grain here, but completely effective...yummy...</td>', 'CRUNCH! .....Totally against the grain here, but completely effective...yummy...', '2005-05-24 15:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408680, 178847, 35804, '<td valign="top">A very intriguing image, I like the light, the setting the dilemma...I think I would have liked to have seen a different crop? Less of that blurry bottom edge...maybe just a simple pan upwards? I keep wanting to see more of the room the spotlit apple is in...still a really cool picture, nicely done.</td>', 'A very intriguing image, I like the light, the setting the dilemma...I think I would have liked to have seen a different crop? Less of that blurry bottom edge...maybe just a simple pan upwards? I keep wanting to see more of the room the spotlit apple is in...still a really cool picture, nicely done.', '2005-05-24 15:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408768, 177529, 38227, '<td valign="top">Good compostion and lighting<br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/></td>', 'Good compostion and lighting           ', '2005-05-24 16:43:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408769, 179254, 37103, '<td valign="top">There were a few photos with an idea similar to this, but this is by far my favorite.  Very good illusion and great detail on the textures.  There is a slight shadow on teh upper right side which draws my attention, I don''t know if you could have avoided this. 9.</td>', 'There were a few photos with an idea similar to this, but this is by far my favorite.  Very good illusion and great detail on the textures.  There is a slight shadow on teh upper right side which draws my attention, I don''t know if you could have avoided this. 9.', '2005-05-24 16:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408771, 179333, 38227, '<td valign="top">good lighting</td>', 'good lighting', '2005-05-24 16:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408772, 179126, 37103, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  I don''t know how you achieved the floating effect.  For me the blue of this apple is too opaque and I can''t see the texture as much as I''d like.</td>', 'Interesting.  I don''t know how you achieved the floating effect.  For me the blue of this apple is too opaque and I can''t see the texture as much as I''d like.', '2005-05-24 16:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408784, 179258, 3741, '<td valign="top">For some reason this puts me in mind of the last scene from Kill Bill: Vol. 1... Totally nifty, both in set-up and execution. (LOL, ''execution'')</td>', 'For some reason this puts me in mind of the last scene from Kill Bill: Vol. 1... Totally nifty, both in set-up and execution. (LOL, ''execution'')', '2005-05-24 16:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408792, 179229, 3741, '<td valign="top">It''s a neat concept, and I like the lighting, but the lack of contrast between the apple and oranges makes it a less-than-spectacular shot.</td>', 'It''s a neat concept, and I like the lighting, but the lack of contrast between the apple and oranges makes it a less-than-spectacular shot.', '2005-05-24 17:00:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408797, 178133, 3741, '<td valign="top">LOL!!! Not only do I get the joke despite my age, but it''s a fab shot! The lighting''s great, and I love the sharp focus on the water droplet. The focal point and the title really give this shot a suspenseful feeling.</td>', 'LOL!!! Not only do I get the joke despite my age, but it''s a fab shot! The lighting''s great, and I love the sharp focus on the water droplet. The focal point and the title really give this shot a suspenseful feeling.', '2005-05-24 17:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408800, 179329, 3087, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful abstract artwork you have created from a small detail in such a well-known object, Beautifully composed, lovely texture and the colour practically glows! Lovely! My very favourite image in this challenge - 10!</td>', 'What a beautiful abstract artwork you have created from a small detail in such a well-known object, Beautifully composed, lovely texture and the colour practically glows! Lovely! My very favourite image in this challenge - 10!', '2005-05-24 17:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408801, 179272, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely use of all-green colour palette. Composition just strikes me straight away - it''s just so balanced it actually reaches out and hits me in the face with that! Lovely! Could easily see this in a magazine - very professional. 9</td>', 'Lovely use of all-green colour palette. Composition just strikes me straight away - it''s just so balanced it actually reaches out and hits me in the face with that! Lovely! Could easily see this in a magazine - very professional. 9', '2005-05-24 17:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408802, 179213, 3087, '<td valign="top">Unusual, quirky, enigmatic, works superbly well in black and white, strong composition and great use of shallow DOF. Very nice! In my top 3 for this challenge. 9</td>', 'Unusual, quirky, enigmatic, works superbly well in black and white, strong composition and great use of shallow DOF. Very nice! In my top 3 for this challenge. 9', '2005-05-24 17:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408803, 178973, 3087, '<td valign="top">Simplicity often beats complexity hands down and I think that shows here. Nothing fancy in terms of content, no clever gimmicks in terms of what''s been done to the apples, just a presentation of the fruit in it''s best light. Lighting and composition excellent, as is background. 9</td>', 'Simplicity often beats complexity hands down and I think that shows here. Nothing fancy in terms of content, no clever gimmicks in terms of what''s been done to the apples, just a presentation of the fruit in it''s best light. Lighting and composition excellent, as is background. 9', '2005-05-24 17:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408804, 178131, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great capture with astonishing clarity on the apple! Nice composition, lovely golden light. The only negative, which I''m sure I won''t be alone in commenting on, is the tilted horizon. 8</td>', 'Great capture with astonishing clarity on the apple! Nice composition, lovely golden light. The only negative, which I''m sure I won''t be alone in commenting on, is the tilted horizon. 8', '2005-05-24 17:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408805, 178055, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely close up. Black and white allows me to focus on tone and shape and light and shadow. Nicely composed too. 8</td>', 'Lovely close up. Black and white allows me to focus on tone and shape and light and shadow. Nicely composed too. 8', '2005-05-24 17:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408806, 177712, 3087, '<td valign="top">Unusual, intriguing, unexpected colour palette in this challenge - stands out wonderfully from the pack. Very creative! 8</td>', 'Unusual, intriguing, unexpected colour palette in this challenge - stands out wonderfully from the pack. Very creative! 8', '2005-05-24 17:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408807, 179146, 3741, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool! The apple looks a little mangled though :P</td>', 'Pretty cool! The apple looks a little mangled though :P', '2005-05-24 17:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408808, 179330, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done, lovely crisp detail. Nice lighting, interesting shadows. 7</td>', 'Beautifully done, lovely crisp detail. Nice lighting, interesting shadows. 7', '2005-05-24 17:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408809, 179317, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely use of lighting to create fascinating opacity and texture. 7</td>', 'Lovely use of lighting to create fascinating opacity and texture. 7', '2005-05-24 17:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408810, 177635, 3087, '<td valign="top">Unusual, quirky, great carving skills, lighting works well. Not keen on soft focus though that''s a personal preference. 7</td>', 'Unusual, quirky, great carving skills, lighting works well. Not keen on soft focus though that''s a personal preference. 7', '2005-05-24 17:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408811, 179250, 3087, '<td valign="top">Love the image - simplicity of content and composition, great use of light and shadow, great use of shallow DOF. Have to say I absolutely hate the border treatment! Way too overpowering to the extent it''s actually very hard to concentrate on the image itself. 7</td>', 'Love the image - simplicity of content and composition, great use of light and shadow, great use of shallow DOF. Have to say I absolutely hate the border treatment! Way too overpowering to the extent it''s actually very hard to concentrate on the image itself. 7', '2005-05-24 17:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408812, 179258, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wow! Clever! White background seems rather harsh and the splash doesn''t show well against it. 7</td>', 'Wow! Clever! White background seems rather harsh and the splash doesn''t show well against it. 7', '2005-05-24 17:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408818, 178938, 3741, '<td valign="top">That looks so refreshing! Colour contrast is great, I like the concept, and I want to ingest it. Great shot!</td>', 'That looks so refreshing! Colour contrast is great, I like the concept, and I want to ingest it. Great shot!', '2005-05-24 17:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408825, 178844, 11278, '<td valign="top">catch any?</td>', 'catch any?', '2005-05-24 17:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408827, 178850, 3741, '<td valign="top">Very mod concept, but the bubbles (are they bubbles???) detract from the over-all feel of the shot. Certainly A for effort! It''s still a well-composed shot, and if it weren''t for the bubbles, I''d so have a poster-sized copy for my wall! (PS: I''m such a nut for deco, mod and psychedellic art :P)</td>', 'Very mod concept, but the bubbles (are they bubbles???) detract from the over-all feel of the shot. Certainly A for effort! It''s still a well-composed shot, and if it weren''t for the bubbles, I''d so have a poster-sized copy for my wall! (PS: I''m such a nut for deco, mod and psychedellic art :P)', '2005-05-24 17:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408828, 179384, 31230, '<td valign="top">LOL.  My favorite restaurant BTW.</td>', 'LOL.  My favorite restaurant BTW.', '2005-05-24 17:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408833, 178389, 11278, '<td valign="top">good idea, but the color is a little dull and the focus soft.</td>', 'good idea, but the color is a little dull and the focus soft.', '2005-05-24 17:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408838, 179248, 3741, '<td valign="top">Creepy... Is this an alien-abduction shot? :P Funny we just had the "silhouettes" challenge. I find the surface the apple is on a little distracting. LOL, if the lighting was a bit more intense, it would have more of an alien-abduction look, but my guess is that you were going more for stark and somber :P</td>', 'Creepy... Is this an alien-abduction shot? :P Funny we just had the "silhouettes" challenge. I find the surface the apple is on a little distracting. LOL, if the lighting was a bit more intense, it would have more of an alien-abduction look, but my guess is that you were going more for stark and somber :P', '2005-05-24 17:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408841, 178366, 11278, '<td valign="top">clever!</td>', 'clever!', '2005-05-24 17:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408843, 177391, 3741, '<td valign="top">LOL! I''m getting quite a few laughs out of this challenge. Great concept and I like how the apple''s red is echoed on the bird (a nuthatch?). Slight improvement would be to have the right edge of the shot a little further from the apple. The apple has more visual mass than the bird, so maybe even the right margin slightly larger than the left.</td>', 'LOL! I''m getting quite a few laughs out of this challenge. Great concept and I like how the apple''s red is echoed on the bird (a nuthatch?). Slight improvement would be to have the right edge of the shot a little further from the apple. The apple has more visual mass than the bird, so maybe even the right margin slightly larger than the left.', '2005-05-24 17:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408848, 179165, 3741, '<td valign="top">Mmmmmmmm... Stop making me hungry guys! I like the concept, the grate is a neat detail, but the subject is hard to ID as an apple. Yes the flames look really cool, but there''s got to be a trade-off point between detailed apple and cool flames.</td>', 'Mmmmmmmm... Stop making me hungry guys! I like the concept, the grate is a neat detail, but the subject is hard to ID as an apple. Yes the flames look really cool, but there''s got to be a trade-off point between detailed apple and cool flames.', '2005-05-24 17:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408851, 177473, 3741, '<td valign="top">That''s hysterical! The only points of improvement I can think of are having the whole arrow in the shot (but I''m guessing it''s attached to something so it stays on the dog''s head) and maybe having it in greyscale. LOVE the forlorn look on the little guy''s face, and makes the title more than appropriate.</td>', 'That''s hysterical! The only points of improvement I can think of are having the whole arrow in the shot (but I''m guessing it''s attached to something so it stays on the dog''s head) and maybe having it in greyscale. LOVE the forlorn look on the little guy''s face, and makes the title more than appropriate.', '2005-05-24 17:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408854, 179333, 3741, '<td valign="top">I hate telling people I don''t like their shot... I just find this a boring composition. I really wish I was an expert so I could say WHY it''s boring! Sorry!</td>', 'I hate telling people I don''t like their shot... I just find this a boring composition. I really wish I was an expert so I could say WHY it''s boring! Sorry!', '2005-05-24 17:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408871, 178527, 3741, '<td valign="top">LOL! Amusing and creative for sure! It looks like macro wasn''t used, and that may have improved the look of the apple, and an alternate light source could have been used to prevent flash on the apple. Thumbs up to my fellow amateur!</td>', 'LOL! Amusing and creative for sure! It looks like macro wasn''t used, and that may have improved the look of the apple, and an alternate light source could have been used to prevent flash on the apple. Thumbs up to my fellow amateur!', '2005-05-24 17:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408879, 179375, 3741, '<td valign="top">Woah, psychedellic... I didn''t eat shrooms, did I? That''s freaky... There''s half an apple just THERE! I love the drama of greyscale and this is most certainly a fascinating composition. Can''t wait to find out the details of your set-up!</td>', 'Woah, psychedellic... I didn''t eat shrooms, did I? That''s freaky... There''s half an apple just THERE! I love the drama of greyscale and this is most certainly a fascinating composition. Can''t wait to find out the details of your set-up!', '2005-05-24 17:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408886, 178227, 3741, '<td valign="top">Good try, my fellow amateur! I''m sad about the crop-job, and it might have had more impact from a different angle. Maybe one of these days I should actually submit something :P</td>', 'Good try, my fellow amateur! I''m sad about the crop-job, and it might have had more impact from a different angle. Maybe one of these days I should actually submit something :P', '2005-05-24 17:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408891, 177782, 3741, '<td valign="top">OHMYGOSH! Nice take on the challenge, and she''s just precious! A very nice shot of your little apple :D</td>', 'OHMYGOSH! Nice take on the challenge, and she''s just precious! A very nice shot of your little apple :D', '2005-05-24 17:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408896, 177954, 29148, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition and lighting.</td>', 'Very nice composition and lighting.', '2005-05-24 17:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408898, 179164, 29148, '<td valign="top">Neat idea</td>', 'Neat idea', '2005-05-24 17:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408900, 177875, 3741, '<td valign="top">Don''t eat it!!!! Puts me in mind of "Snow White" :P A nifty shot, and the colours really compliment one another (I''m guessing hue/saturation adjustments?). My only beef is it looks really staged.</td>', 'Don''t eat it!!!! Puts me in mind of "Snow White" :P A nifty shot, and the colours really compliment one another (I''m guessing hue/saturation adjustments?). My only beef is it looks really staged.', '2005-05-24 17:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408905, 177209, 29148, '<td valign="top">Interesting, but I don''t understand. I''m not faulting your shot, I just don''t "get it".</td>', 'Interesting, but I don''t understand. I''m not faulting your shot, I just don''t "get it".', '2005-05-24 17:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408906, 178024, 29148, '<td valign="top">Pretty</td>', 'Pretty', '2005-05-24 17:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408907, 178055, 3741, '<td valign="top">I love macro shots of vegetation and I LOVE greyscale! The ''horizon'' is perfect, the lighting is great, and the fact that the tip of the stem is *almost* part of the focal field is truly commendable.</td>', 'I love macro shots of vegetation and I LOVE greyscale! The ''horizon'' is perfect, the lighting is great, and the fact that the tip of the stem is *almost* part of the focal field is truly commendable.', '2005-05-24 17:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408912, 179297, 3741, '<td valign="top">*SHUDDER* Definitely an emotive shot and well-composed. I truly feel for whoever bit that apple, because I had the same experience once... *SHUDDER*</td>', '*SHUDDER* Definitely an emotive shot and well-composed. I truly feel for whoever bit that apple, because I had the same experience once... *SHUDDER*', '2005-05-24 18:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408913, 177799, 29148, '<td valign="top">Neat. I had a similar idea but could not pull it off. Good job on the composition too.</td>', 'Neat. I had a similar idea but could not pull it off. Good job on the composition too.', '2005-05-24 18:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408918, 177789, 3741, '<td valign="top">COOL! I''m not really sure what to say... An expression of human physical strength with a humourous twist that''s completely in keeping with the challenge. This is an absolutely marvellous shot...</td>', 'COOL! I''m not really sure what to say... An expression of human physical strength with a humourous twist that''s completely in keeping with the challenge. This is an absolutely marvellous shot...', '2005-05-24 18:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408922, 179301, 29148, '<td valign="top">Good shot (pun intended), but wasn''t the apple shot off William''s son''s head? (How many people told you that?)</td>', 'Good shot (pun intended), but wasn''t the apple shot off William''s son''s head? (How many people told you that?)', '2005-05-24 18:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408925, 179279, 29148, '<td valign="top">Novel idea</td>', 'Novel idea', '2005-05-24 18:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408930, 177430, 3741, '<td valign="top">I don''t get it... I guess I''m having a blonde moment :P I''m guessing that the tail-lights and stop-lights really popping out like that are due to digital processing. What I like best is the expression on the guy''s face: "Ya man, I got an apple." The crop-job is pretty great, too.</td>', 'I don''t get it... I guess I''m having a blonde moment :P I''m guessing that the tail-lights and stop-lights really popping out like that are due to digital processing. What I like best is the expression on the guy''s face: "Ya man, I got an apple." The crop-job is pretty great, too.', '2005-05-24 18:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408935, 178631, 3741, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm, the colours don''t really contrast enough, and you can''t see all of the margins of the plate clearly. Neat concept, though, and the title works.</td>', 'Hmmmm, the colours don''t really contrast enough, and you can''t see all of the margins of the plate clearly. Neat concept, though, and the title works.', '2005-05-24 18:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408936, 179314, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very exciting action capture and you get credit for the good presentation. Now, because this challenge is "apple" I have beem able to identify the fruit. Otherwise it would have taken me a little more time as it is not readilly apparant to identify it. 6</td>', 'A very exciting action capture and you get credit for the good presentation. Now, because this challenge is "apple" I have beem able to identify the fruit. Otherwise it would have taken me a little more time as it is not readilly apparant to identify it. 6', '2005-05-24 18:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408937, 178267, 3741, '<td valign="top">Not overly original, but the shot itself is well done. Nice lighting and no distracting elements.</td>', 'Not overly original, but the shot itself is well done. Nice lighting and no distracting elements.', '2005-05-24 18:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408938, 179195, 29148, '<td valign="top">Good photo idea. Why is food all lined up? A more spontaneous composition might improve it.</td>', 'Good photo idea. Why is food all lined up? A more spontaneous composition might improve it.', '2005-05-24 18:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408940, 179047, 29148, '<td valign="top">I like it.</td>', 'I like it.', '2005-05-24 18:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408943, 179123, 29148, '<td valign="top">A pox on anyone who rated this down just because they don''t like insects. Very clear shot.</td>', 'A pox on anyone who rated this down just because they don''t like insects. Very clear shot.', '2005-05-24 18:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408944, 179120, 3741, '<td valign="top">LOL, that''s not an apple, that WAS an apple. Way to go on the originality, and the shot is nicely centred. Though there are a few distracting elements, I still like it. I sure wouldn''t want to be an apple with a swarm of ants like that around :P</td>', 'LOL, that''s not an apple, that WAS an apple. Way to go on the originality, and the shot is nicely centred. Though there are a few distracting elements, I still like it. I sure wouldn''t want to be an apple with a swarm of ants like that around :P', '2005-05-24 18:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408948, 178386, 29148, '<td valign="top">Novel</td>', 'Novel', '2005-05-24 18:12:01.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1408952, 179150, 29148, '<td valign="top">Nice fit.</td>', 'Nice fit.', '2005-05-24 18:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408955, 179274, 3741, '<td valign="top">LOL, I bet that was tasty! I like the lighting and the placement of the subject in the shot. Overall a nice composition.</td>', 'LOL, I bet that was tasty! I like the lighting and the placement of the subject in the shot. Overall a nice composition.', '2005-05-24 18:14:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408968, 179030, 3741, '<td valign="top">Props for originality! A very creative and visually-pleasing arrangement of vegetation. I''ll be dissapointed if this isn''t one of the top scorers.</td>', 'Props for originality! A very creative and visually-pleasing arrangement of vegetation. I''ll be dissapointed if this isn''t one of the top scorers.', '2005-05-24 18:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408970, 179298, 12809, '<td valign="top">I think you should sell this on Ebay!  Why not, people are selling their carved toast!  Good carving!</td>', 'I think you should sell this on Ebay!  Why not, people are selling their carved toast!  Good carving!', '2005-05-24 18:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408974, 179378, 3741, '<td valign="top">Neat concept, but the lighting is too stark. The composition itself is nice, but that intense light vs shadow just doesn''t do it for the subject matter IMO</td>', 'Neat concept, but the lighting is too stark. The composition itself is nice, but that intense light vs shadow just doesn''t do it for the subject matter IMO', '2005-05-24 18:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408981, 178775, 3741, '<td valign="top">Nice! Simple and elegant :D I think it would have been even neater if one of the red apples was yellow to have all three colours present, though some digital adjustment might have been needed to make the yellow as intense as the green and red. Still one of the best I''ve seen so far.</td>', 'Nice! Simple and elegant :D I think it would have been even neater if one of the red apples was yellow to have all three colours present, though some digital adjustment might have been needed to make the yellow as intense as the green and red. Still one of the best I''ve seen so far.', '2005-05-24 18:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408989, 179059, 3741, '<td valign="top">Very neat! A great set-up overall (including lighting) and an original concept. It''d be neat to see a re-take using a crab-apple in liquid.</td>', 'Very neat! A great set-up overall (including lighting) and an original concept. It''d be neat to see a re-take using a crab-apple in liquid.', '2005-05-24 18:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1408993, 179378, 21894, '<td valign="top">Nice Concept of where your coming from but it needs more lighting and a filter to add more flava to the photography</td>', 'Nice Concept of where your coming from but it needs more lighting and a filter to add more flava to the photography', '2005-05-24 18:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409000, 179294, 3741, '<td valign="top">Pow! I''ve just been mentally smacked in the face! That''s absolutely fabulous! The colours just pop, the concept ROCKS, and I can imagine how many takes were done to get this beauty! *APPLAUSE*</td>', 'Pow! I''ve just been mentally smacked in the face! That''s absolutely fabulous! The colours just pop, the concept ROCKS, and I can imagine how many takes were done to get this beauty! *APPLAUSE*', '2005-05-24 18:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409004, 179120, 21894, '<td valign="top">i like this picture. well two reason if you focused more or crop the picture or desaturate it</td>', 'i like this picture. well two reason if you focused more or crop the picture or desaturate it', '2005-05-24 18:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409008, 179358, 21894, '<td valign="top">are you holding this apple with a string. if so i can ssee it. i liike the pic</td>', 'are you holding this apple with a string. if so i can ssee it. i liike the pic', '2005-05-24 18:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409010, 177705, 3741, '<td valign="top">Even without the apple, this would be a really nice shot :P I wonder how much processing was done, because that apple is just glowing in the sunlight. I love the colour contrast of the apple with the rest of the image and the choice of strake to set it on is perfect.</td>', 'Even without the apple, this would be a really nice shot :P I wonder how much processing was done, because that apple is just glowing in the sunlight. I love the colour contrast of the apple with the rest of the image and the choice of strake to set it on is perfect.', '2005-05-24 18:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409017, 179250, 21894, '<td valign="top">Nice Concept and nice composition. OK focus more on the pictureand the lighting you should adjust . i just like it</td>', 'Nice Concept and nice composition. OK focus more on the pictureand the lighting you should adjust . i just like it', '2005-05-24 18:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409019, 177499, 3741, '<td valign="top">WOAH! Is that a slice lit with a laser from behind? Definitely original with serious visual impact.</td>', 'WOAH! Is that a slice lit with a laser from behind? Definitely original with serious visual impact.', '2005-05-24 18:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409020, 179086, 21894, '<td valign="top">i like this photo stunning. the background could have been blured out just a little more</td>', 'i like this photo stunning. the background could have been blured out just a little more', '2005-05-24 18:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409022, 178157, 25218, '<td valign="top">Nice pose, and good lighting. It''s very heavily sharpened, which I suspect you were trying to compensate for being a little out of focus?</td>', 'Nice pose, and good lighting. It''s very heavily sharpened, which I suspect you were trying to compensate for being a little out of focus?', '2005-05-24 18:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409024, 177756, 3741, '<td valign="top">LOL! Definitely original and amusing, but I think it would have had more impact in a studio-like setting.</td>', 'LOL! Definitely original and amusing, but I think it would have had more impact in a studio-like setting.', '2005-05-24 18:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409027, 179167, 3741, '<td valign="top">Nicely done! A cool concept and executed well.</td>', 'Nicely done! A cool concept and executed well.', '2005-05-24 18:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409030, 177547, 21894, '<td valign="top">i like it. The lighting is nice</td>', 'i like it. The lighting is nice', '2005-05-24 18:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409034, 179113, 21894, '<td valign="top">I like this pcture but it doesnt say much. i like the desaturation etc good job</td>', 'I like this pcture but it doesnt say much. i like the desaturation etc good job', '2005-05-24 18:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409035, 178454, 21894, '<td valign="top">i get it. but it looks out of focus</td>', 'i get it. but it looks out of focus', '2005-05-24 18:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409036, 179257, 25218, '<td valign="top">With the blue cast, this apple  is not pleasing to look at. If you weren''t going for this look, try to see if your camera has a white balance setting for auto, or instead, adding a little yellow in Photoshop or post-processing program would give the photo a more realistic hue. Decent composition, though</td>', 'With the blue cast, this apple  is not pleasing to look at. If you weren''t going for this look, try to see if your camera has a white balance setting for auto, or instead, adding a little yellow in Photoshop or post-processing program would give the photo a more realistic hue. Decent composition, though', '2005-05-24 18:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409037, 177984, 32848, '<td valign="top">Nice effect, it would be nice to see just how you did this.</td>', 'Nice effect, it would be nice to see just how you did this.', '2005-05-24 18:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409039, 178698, 3741, '<td valign="top">Wow, took a while to find the image you''re referring to, but a nice take on it.</td>', 'Wow, took a while to find the image you''re referring to, but a nice take on it.', '2005-05-24 18:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409041, 179317, 25218, '<td valign="top">Very striking, other-wordly feel to this. I like the color and I think the border adds to the photo (even though I would bet some are complaining about it).</td>', 'Very striking, other-wordly feel to this. I like the color and I think the border adds to the photo (even though I would bet some are complaining about it).', '2005-05-24 18:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409042, 179314, 3741, '<td valign="top">I love these "splash" shots, but it''s hard to tell that''s an apple slice.</td>', 'I love these "splash" shots, but it''s hard to tell that''s an apple slice.', '2005-05-24 18:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409046, 178975, 8125, '<td valign="top">I like this set up.  There are only 2 things that I could significantly suggest: The water spots on the bottom (but I know that''s hard to deal with in basic editing) and the apples appear to be really close to the background since I can see a hard shadow; granted it''s not much of a shadow.  All in all I think this is very good and my suggestions are truly just minor little picks.  I hope this image does well!  :-)</td>', 'I like this set up.  There are only 2 things that I could significantly suggest: The water spots on the bottom (but I know that''s hard to deal with in basic editing) and the apples appear to be really close to the background since I can see a hard shadow; granted it''s not much of a shadow.  All in all I think this is very good and my suggestions are truly just minor little picks.  I hope this image does well!  :-)', '2005-05-24 18:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409051, 177125, 21894, '<td valign="top">Guess what! i like this photo. this could be the winning shot. use a green apple and a smaller one. the background is nice but its just there if u had a spalsh effect or anything that would improve the picture would be nice</td>', 'Guess what! i like this photo. this could be the winning shot. use a green apple and a smaller one. the background is nice but its just there if u had a spalsh effect or anything that would improve the picture would be nice', '2005-05-24 18:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409052, 179376, 21894, '<td valign="top">like where your coming from but this picture doesnt say much</td>', 'like where your coming from but this picture doesnt say much', '2005-05-24 18:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409053, 177209, 21894, '<td valign="top">this is a print availbe shot good job</td>', 'this is a print availbe shot good job', '2005-05-24 18:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409054, 179282, 8125, '<td valign="top">I like this image a lot... looks cool.  I''m curious to see the how''d you do that.  I have an idea how I would accomplish it, but I wonder if it''s the same as what you did.  My only pick would be the two bright spots on the front of the apple, my eyes are really drawn to them.</td>', 'I like this image a lot... looks cool.  I''m curious to see the how''d you do that.  I have an idea how I would accomplish it, but I wonder if it''s the same as what you did.  My only pick would be the two bright spots on the front of the apple, my eyes are really drawn to them.', '2005-05-24 18:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409055, 178518, 3741, '<td valign="top">Well done! Nice lighting and composition.</td>', 'Well done! Nice lighting and composition.', '2005-05-24 18:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409057, 178938, 21894, '<td valign="top">if you had crop the green apple which is distracting me this is the winning shot ive seenn so far.</td>', 'if you had crop the green apple which is distracting me this is the winning shot ive seenn so far.', '2005-05-24 18:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409064, 177390, 8125, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  I like the composition here.</td>', 'Very nice shot.  I like the composition here.', '2005-05-24 18:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409068, 178973, 8125, '<td valign="top">It is simple - but I like the one a lot.  I like the slight gradient background - the lighting looks great to me.  Nice work!</td>', 'It is simple - but I like the one a lot.  I like the slight gradient background - the lighting looks great to me.  Nice work!', '2005-05-24 18:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409076, 178579, 21894, '<td valign="top">This is the BEST shot ive seen so far. i have no problem good job. oh take the white stuff the stem</td>', 'This is the BEST shot ive seen so far. i have no problem good job. oh take the white stuff the stem', '2005-05-24 18:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
