(1409258, 178345, 30817, '<td valign="top">As we voters have found out, it is not easy to make art out of an apple using a camera. But, you have succeeded admirably. This slice of focus cuts like a paring knife into its center, revealing an almost breathing lifeform.  The furlike fuzz on the stalk makes this fruit nearly animal-like in suggestion. My pick for the blue this week and so have added to my favorites list.</td>', 'As we voters have found out, it is not easy to make art out of an apple using a camera. But, you have succeeded admirably. This slice of focus cuts like a paring knife into its center, revealing an almost breathing lifeform.  The furlike fuzz on the stalk makes this fruit nearly animal-like in suggestion. My pick for the blue this week and so have added to my favorites list.', '2005-05-24 20:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409261, 179031, 21894, '<td valign="top">ive seen a photo like this before. but in order for it to be forbidden the model would hve to be naked and positioned at a different angle. try again on this photo and use a red apple. 5</td>', 'ive seen a photo like this before. but in order for it to be forbidden the model would hve to be naked and positioned at a different angle. try again on this photo and use a red apple. 5', '2005-05-24 20:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409264, 176963, 30817, '<td valign="top">This is a reminder to us that titles DO matter.  Just through those simple two words, you justified a less than pristine background.  Only thing to make this scene work any better is if the vase had had a slight blemish to it and the tabletop marred. One of my top ten.</td>', 'This is a reminder to us that titles DO matter.  Just through those simple two words, you justified a less than pristine background.  Only thing to make this scene work any better is if the vase had had a slight blemish to it and the tabletop marred. One of my top ten.', '2005-05-24 20:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409265, 179309, 30817, '<td valign="top">This challenge brought out the usual reviews by the "splash" photographers, to whom water is manna.  But this perspective is unique among them today.  It is quite fortunate you got one shot with approximately half the apple clearly visible and half covered in those great bubbles. One of my top 10 votes.</td>', 'This challenge brought out the usual reviews by the "splash" photographers, to whom water is manna.  But this perspective is unique among them today.  It is quite fortunate you got one shot with approximately half the apple clearly visible and half covered in those great bubbles. One of my top 10 votes.', '2005-05-24 20:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409268, 178131, 30817, '<td valign="top">Best animal shot in the challenge and a strong contender to ribbon, this is a case of the subject dictating the rotation instead of the mainstream thinking, "The horizon MUST be level." This works because it makes sense. If people were honest, they would realize horizons are NOT always level because people change perspective all the time in their daily living. This is one my top ten shots for this challenge. Congratulations.</td>', 'Best animal shot in the challenge and a strong contender to ribbon, this is a case of the subject dictating the rotation instead of the mainstream thinking, "The horizon MUST be level." This works because it makes sense. If people were honest, they would realize horizons are NOT always level because people change perspective all the time in their daily living. This is one my top ten shots for this challenge. Congratulations.', '2005-05-24 20:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409270, 179328, 30817, '<td valign="top">I like this on many different levels.  It is creative, fun, technically advanced and that kid is just the perfect bobber! His freckles make this so classic that one cannot help but smile warmly when looking at this.  Only way to make this better is if those trees on the left were replaced by other party-goer''s faces watching the action with joyful smiles. One of my top ten in this challenge.</td>', 'I like this on many different levels.  It is creative, fun, technically advanced and that kid is just the perfect bobber! His freckles make this so classic that one cannot help but smile warmly when looking at this.  Only way to make this better is if those trees on the left were replaced by other party-goer''s faces watching the action with joyful smiles. One of my top ten in this challenge.', '2005-05-24 20:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409272, 179366, 21894, '<td valign="top">i like this photo. but there is too much darkness. i dont have a problem with it but you need to crop the photo. full the frame of your photo with the apple and not the darkness 9 crop it u get a 10 this is a top 10 photo this is top 10 photo top 20 photo and possible a ribbon photo</td>', 'i like this photo. but there is too much darkness. i dont have a problem with it but you need to crop the photo. full the frame of your photo with the apple and not the darkness 9 crop it u get a 10 this is a top 10 photo this is top 10 photo top 20 photo and possible a ribbon photo', '2005-05-24 20:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409273, 178932, 30817, '<td valign="top">The suggested upward and left motion of the clouds lends itself perfectly to this wonderful composition. It is almost as if the clouds threw the apples. One of my top 10 picks.</td>', 'The suggested upward and left motion of the clouds lends itself perfectly to this wonderful composition. It is almost as if the clouds threw the apples. One of my top 10 picks.', '2005-05-24 20:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409275, 179086, 30817, '<td valign="top">Will be interested in your method for production of this image. Perhaps a photo in the background?  I like this a lot and consider it one of the ten best for this week''s challenge.</td>', 'Will be interested in your method for production of this image. Perhaps a photo in the background?  I like this a lot and consider it one of the ten best for this week''s challenge.', '2005-05-24 20:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409279, 177390, 21894, '<td valign="top">this is a pictue</td>', 'this is a pictue', '2005-05-24 20:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409280, 178901, 30817, '<td valign="top">The dark, self-mutilated apple with an attitude.  I was immediately attracted to this image (though I am not attracted to its human counterpart.) This one truly made me smile with its understated nuances aligned with its overstated brash title. Well crafted work.  One of my top ten picks.</td>', 'The dark, self-mutilated apple with an attitude.  I was immediately attracted to this image (though I am not attracted to its human counterpart.) This one truly made me smile with its understated nuances aligned with its overstated brash title. Well crafted work.  One of my top ten picks.', '2005-05-24 20:13:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409281, 178043, 21894, '<td valign="top">good job</td>', 'good job', '2005-05-24 20:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409282, 177174, 21894, '<td valign="top">add more contrast</td>', 'add more contrast', '2005-05-24 20:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409284, 179343, 30817, '<td valign="top">This got into my personal top ten this week because it is so well conceived and executed.  The striped background works so very well with the organic lines of the pineapple top.  I wonder if a pale green tabletop would not have worked better to compliment the composition. Fun shot!</td>', 'This got into my personal top ten this week because it is so well conceived and executed.  The striped background works so very well with the organic lines of the pineapple top.  I wonder if a pale green tabletop would not have worked better to compliment the composition. Fun shot!', '2005-05-24 20:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409285, 179024, 21894, '<td valign="top">nice contrast nice photo</td>', 'nice contrast nice photo', '2005-05-24 20:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409286, 179083, 30817, '<td valign="top">This is a very wonderful interpretation on the theme.  I know you were going for a soft look here, however my gut feeling is a very sharp (almost, but not quite. oversharpened) texture with some noise (or grain) to somewhat diffuse it would get you better results.  The clouds, the ground, the apples and primarily, the subject''s face all cry out for greater definition. Try it, if you don''t like it, you can always click "undo."</td>', 'This is a very wonderful interpretation on the theme.  I know you were going for a soft look here, however my gut feeling is a very sharp (almost, but not quite. oversharpened) texture with some noise (or grain) to somewhat diffuse it would get you better results.  The clouds, the ground, the apples and primarily, the subject''s face all cry out for greater definition. Try it, if you don''t like it, you can always click "undo."', '2005-05-24 20:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409291, 177473, 30817, '<td valign="top">Of the "arrow through apple on head" shots, this is the best! The weary, "Take the photo, already..." look is perfect.</td>', 'Of the "arrow through apple on head" shots, this is the best! The weary, "Take the photo, already..." look is perfect.', '2005-05-24 20:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409295, 179171, 21894, '<td valign="top">i was about to give u an 2 but when i saw u used the apple i cracked up. 8</td>', 'i was about to give u an 2 but when i saw u used the apple i cracked up. 8', '2005-05-24 20:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409296, 178340, 30817, '<td valign="top">This is distinctly different and has loads of hiding places of interest to beg exploration. This is really so very cool ... except ... for the huge stripe of light reflection down the center. You should have tried to mask that with some card stock or explored a better angle which would have eliminated it.  Without that big, distracting glare, I would have given this an 8 or 9. As it is, I gave it a 6.</td>', 'This is distinctly different and has loads of hiding places of interest to beg exploration. This is really so very cool ... except ... for the huge stripe of light reflection down the center. You should have tried to mask that with some card stock or explored a better angle which would have eliminated it.  Without that big, distracting glare, I would have given this an 8 or 9. As it is, I gave it a 6.', '2005-05-24 20:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409298, 179195, 21894, '<td valign="top">change the angle</td>', 'change the angle', '2005-05-24 20:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409299, 177125, 30817, '<td valign="top">Boy, you went to all this work to come up with the perfect layout to compliment your subject and them shot an apple with the dynamic vitality of a turtle! If you had only found a succulent, crisp, vibrant apple, this might have ribboned. The B&amp;W setup is stunning!!!</td>', 'Boy, you went to all this work to come up with the perfect layout to compliment your subject and them shot an apple with the dynamic vitality of a turtle! If you had only found a succulent, crisp, vibrant apple, this might have ribboned. The B&W setup is stunning!!!', '2005-05-24 20:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409302, 178881, 21894, '<td valign="top">i look at your photo without looking on the title and i said the same thing. mine!! this was once in a blue moon shot... so i gave u yoour props and gave a 8 change the angle and make me feel as if im there</td>', 'i look at your photo without looking on the title and i said the same thing. mine!! this was once in a blue moon shot... so i gave u yoour props and gave a 8 change the angle and make me feel as if im there', '2005-05-24 20:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409303, 177710, 30817, '<td valign="top">I like this so very much, but if mine, I would crop the top down to eliminate the lamp shade. The light against the wall suggests the lamp top perfectly without the glaring intrusion that the shade now presents. I would also crop out the clothing on the right. They seem so out of place in this scene.  The sepia tone is terrific for this piece.</td>', 'I like this so very much, but if mine, I would crop the top down to eliminate the lamp shade. The light against the wall suggests the lamp top perfectly without the glaring intrusion that the shade now presents. I would also crop out the clothing on the right. They seem so out of place in this scene.  The sepia tone is terrific for this piece.', '2005-05-24 20:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409305, 177954, 21894, '<td valign="top">nice shot. change the apple to a cleaner one or use a fake one. when ur shooting fruits u want to use the best no spot none blemish fruit. if u had buy a young apple that would work also</td>', 'nice shot. change the apple to a cleaner one or use a fake one. when ur shooting fruits u want to use the best no spot none blemish fruit. if u had buy a young apple that would work also', '2005-05-24 20:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
