(1409324, 177645, 30817, '<td valign="top">This is a troubling image, and not troubling in a potentially positive way that forces one to ponder in order to reevaluate one''s beliefs. But, this is troubling in an I-can-harm-because-I-am-more-aggressive way.  Did you even think about the fact that real little children are harmed every Halloween by people passing out laced apples? Certainly nothing blatant like your image, but to me, that harm is what this represents.  This is a quick and easy shocker of a shot that is not that good photographically either. Big time hotspot from your light source. Do good with your talents. Do good. 2.</td>', 'This is a troubling image, and not troubling in a potentially positive way that forces one to ponder in order to reevaluate one''s beliefs. But, this is troubling in an I-can-harm-because-I-am-more-aggressive way.  Did you even think about the fact that real little children are harmed every Halloween by people passing out laced apples? Certainly nothing blatant like your image, but to me, that harm is what this represents.  This is a quick and easy shocker of a shot that is not that good photographically either. Big time hotspot from your light source. Do good with your talents. Do good. 2.', '2005-05-24 20:29:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409328, 179087, 30817, '<td valign="top">The plastic was a good idea to add a dreamlike quality to the shot, but the embossing detracts in every square inch of the composition making it almost a non-photograph. 2.</td>', 'The plastic was a good idea to add a dreamlike quality to the shot, but the embossing detracts in every square inch of the composition making it almost a non-photograph. 2.', '2005-05-24 20:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
