(1409335, 179343, 8125, '<td valign="top">Very cool idea... I like this one.  I wish it wasn''t obvious that the background appears to be some sort of blinds... but it''s hard to do with basic editing.  I honestly wouldn''t suggest changing the background either - I think the texture is part of the appeal.  Nice work.  :-)</td>', 'Very cool idea... I like this one.  I wish it wasn''t obvious that the background appears to be some sort of blinds... but it''s hard to do with basic editing.  I honestly wouldn''t suggest changing the background either - I think the texture is part of the appeal.  Nice work.  :-)', '2005-05-24 20:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
