(1409502, 177391, 36141, '<td valign="top">I think he''s fleeing for Wilhelm Tell, but I don''t know if you know that story, but you can find it here <a href="//history-switzerland.geschichte-schweiz.ch/william-tell-switzerland-hero.html" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//history-switzerland.geschichte-schweiz.ch/william-tell-switzerland-hero.html</a>. Don''t know if links are permitted here.<br/>Love the red apple and the red head of the bird.</td>', 'I think he''s fleeing for Wilhelm Tell, but I don''t know if you know that story, but you can find it here //history-switzerland.geschichte-schweiz.ch/william-tell-switzerland-hero.html. Don''t know if links are permitted here.Love the red apple and the red head of the bird.', '2005-05-24 21:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1409505, 177645, 36141, '<td valign="top">Mmmm...I thought Eva said that to Adam in the past LOL, it''s a sticky one isn''t it.</td>', 'Mmmm...I thought Eva said that to Adam in the past LOL, it''s a sticky one isn''t it.', '2005-05-24 21:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
