(1409839, 178385, 33736, '<td valign="top">Too convoluted a theme for me.  Love the copper against the red and green, but not the third apple.  A variety in the level of their positions, more dramatic background, something to raise the interest.  This isn''t truly a bad image - it just isn''t holding my attention.</td>', 'Too convoluted a theme for me.  Love the copper against the red and green, but not the third apple.  A variety in the level of their positions, more dramatic background, something to raise the interest.  This isn''t truly a bad image - it just isn''t holding my attention.', '2005-05-24 23:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
