(1409845, 178389, 5705, '<td valign="top">This is a great way to show your apple, I really like the setup--<br/>I am gonna say a couple things that probably have been commented on before though-<br/> <br/>First, its noisy,  check your ISO, and if it cant be hand held to get a suitable shutter speed at a lower iso, then get a cheap tripod.<br/> <br/>Second, and Im not voting lower for this, you have a few hot pixels, in the members challenge they are easily coned out, but they cant here..<br/> <br/>I really like the apple, next time use a tripos, shoot at a lower ISO-- or use neat image, Its legal in Open Challenges..<br/> <br/>Still a 6- becuase I think this has potentential..<br/> <br/>Buzz</td>', 'This is a great way to show your apple, I really like the setup--I am gonna say a couple things that probably have been commented on before though- First, its noisy,  check your ISO, and if it cant be hand held to get a suitable shutter speed at a lower iso, then get a cheap tripod. Second, and Im not voting lower for this, you have a few hot pixels, in the members challenge they are easily coned out, but they cant here.. I really like the apple, next time use a tripos, shoot at a lower ISO-- or use neat image, Its legal in Open Challenges.. Still a 6- becuase I think this has potentential.. Buzz', '2005-05-24 23:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
