(1409871, 178843, 33736, '<td valign="top">I would have found this a little more interesting if you had selected shinier apples to atch the glaze of the bowl (those two little chips could have been darkened with Old English or something.)  <br/> <br/>On a less patterned, darker ground, having three smaller apples instead of two, in a bowl, whose handles are turned more to the diagonal - should create more movement, less flat feeling.  6</td>', 'I would have found this a little more interesting if you had selected shinier apples to atch the glaze of the bowl (those two little chips could have been darkened with Old English or something.)   On a less patterned, darker ground, having three smaller apples instead of two, in a bowl, whose handles are turned more to the diagonal - should create more movement, less flat feeling.  6', '2005-05-24 23:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
