(1410619, 178862, 27845, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments. The apple was illuminated from inside. You can still see the red electricity cable on the branch above. It''s not even an apple tree :)<br/>The light strokes were painted with a small green LED. Hard to control, and impossible to get into focus, since I was working with F/2,8.<br/>It didn''t turn out quite the way I wanted it, but I lurned a lot during this challenge. I have many outtakes and some great ideas which I''ll try out during my holidays.</td>', 'Thanks for the comments. The apple was illuminated from inside. You can still see the red electricity cable on the branch above. It''s not even an apple tree :)The light strokes were painted with a small green LED. Hard to control, and impossible to get into focus, since I was working with F/2,8.It didn''t turn out quite the way I wanted it, but I lurned a lot during this challenge. I have many outtakes and some great ideas which I''ll try out during my holidays.', '2005-05-25 03:51:46.000000', NULL, 0),
