(1410827, 178870, 27099, '<td valign="top">Thank you for all your great comments. <br/> <br/>This is my 2 year old lab Noah. He is a ''demo'' dog for the organization Canines with a Cause and trained to do all sorts of tasks such as picking up items that fall (dime, wallet, keys, papers, pens...) and bring them to your hand, bring the phone on command, open/close doors, press automatic access buttons, pull socks off, even flush the toilet! Needless to say, asking him to stay still while I took this picture was a piece of cake for him. <br/> <br/>...and yes. He did get a BIG treat afterwads! and a big hug too. ;-)</td>', 'Thank you for all your great comments.  This is my 2 year old lab Noah. He is a ''demo'' dog for the organization Canines with a Cause and trained to do all sorts of tasks such as picking up items that fall (dime, wallet, keys, papers, pens...) and bring them to your hand, bring the phone on command, open/close doors, press automatic access buttons, pull socks off, even flush the toilet! Needless to say, asking him to stay still while I took this picture was a piece of cake for him.  ...and yes. He did get a BIG treat afterwads! and a big hug too. ;-)', '2005-05-25 07:17:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(1410828, 178901, 33652, '<td valign="top">Just wanted to note that I got the idea for staples from an image in the Pain Challenge by Nospeak called <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=144967" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">forbidden fruit</a>. I got the idea to colour the apple all  by myself!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-05-25 06:18:08.</i></td>', 'Just wanted to note that I got the idea for staples from an image in the Pain Challenge by Nospeak called forbidden fruit. I got the idea to colour the apple all  by myself!', '2005-05-25 07:17:12.000000', '2005-05-25 07:18:08.000000', 0),
(1410829, 177645, 35947, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone for your comments!  I''m glad some people can see the humor and I''m glad I kind of pushed some buttons too!  As far as doing only "good" with photography (or anything else really) I believe we need to push the envelope sometimes.  I don''t agree with some opinons but I would fit to the death your right to them.  Use or lose.  To quote Mr. E. Friendly (Demolition Man starring Sly S., Wes Snipes, Sandra B. to name just a few!) "I have seen the future!  It''s a bunch of 40 year old virgins sitting around singing I wish I was an Oscar Meyer Weiner!"  Be Well!</td>', 'Thanks everyone for your comments!  I''m glad some people can see the humor and I''m glad I kind of pushed some buttons too!  As far as doing only "good" with photography (or anything else really) I believe we need to push the envelope sometimes.  I don''t agree with some opinons but I would fit to the death your right to them.  Use or lose.  To quote Mr. E. Friendly (Demolition Man starring Sly S., Wes Snipes, Sandra B. to name just a few!) "I have seen the future!  It''s a bunch of 40 year old virgins sitting around singing I wish I was an Oscar Meyer Weiner!"  Be Well!', '2005-05-25 07:17:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(1410831, 179167, 27812, '<td valign="top">Tony, good use of DOF... nothing wrong with this pic...</td>', 'Tony, good use of DOF... nothing wrong with this pic...', '2005-05-25 07:19:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(1410832, 179151, 27812, '<td valign="top">I thought this shows real creativity, sorry it did not end higher. Be proud of a great pic in any case.</td>', 'I thought this shows real creativity, sorry it did not end higher. Be proud of a great pic in any case.', '2005-05-25 07:20:32.000000', NULL, 0),
