(1411037, 179123, 37215, '<td valign="top">Pleased with my final score for yet another pic taken quickly on the final day. I think some people reacted badly to the tarantula and the score MAY have suffered due to that (judging by the number of comments of Urgh! or similar I received). He is a great subject so he may reappear at later date. Beware!</td>', 'Pleased with my final score for yet another pic taken quickly on the final day. I think some people reacted badly to the tarantula and the score MAY have suffered due to that (judging by the number of comments of Urgh! or similar I received). He is a great subject so he may reappear at later date. Beware!', '2005-05-25 09:53:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(1411052, 178131, 8891, '<td valign="top">Great capture, Michael! One of my tens! Many congrats on your first ribbon!</td>', 'Great capture, Michael! One of my tens! Many congrats on your first ribbon!', '2005-05-25 10:01:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(1411066, 179326, 8891, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bear_music:</b></div><hr/><i> You wuz robbed, wil. I shout it from the rooftops! </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I agree...it was one of my tens and it is a very striking image. Love the lighting, colors and detail and the subject stands out well. Centering was a great way to go. Congrats on your top 20 finish.</td>', 'Originally posted by bear_music: You wuz robbed, wil. I shout it from the rooftops!  I agree...it was one of my tens and it is a very striking image. Love the lighting, colors and detail and the subject stands out well. Centering was a great way to go. Congrats on your top 20 finish.', '2005-05-25 10:07:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(1411080, 179326, 5391, '<td valign="top">Absolutely stunning range in the color palette, all sort of working together to create a masterpiece.  I didn''t get a chance to vote on this shot, but it deserved an 11.  Added to my favorites!</td>', 'Absolutely stunning range in the color palette, all sort of working together to create a masterpiece.  I didn''t get a chance to vote on this shot, but it deserved an 11.  Added to my favorites!', '2005-05-25 10:13:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(1411109, 179336, 346, '<td valign="top">Such a shame this didn''t do better. I had it as a winner!</td>', 'Such a shame this didn''t do better. I had it as a winner!', '2005-05-25 10:25:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(1411153, 179164, 34459, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments - I agree the flow of juice is too transparent/apple not green enough/whole thing too ''flat''. This was because, to remove the shadow cast by the meccano that was suspending the apple in mid-air, I held a piece of tracing paper across the window alongside the set-up. Whilst this did a great job of removing the shadow, it left the whole shot looking not properly lit. I tried in PS but still couldn''t get it right.<br/> <br/>graphicfunk: I see you had fun with the shadow in your similar shot (which was better :-)! ) <br/> <br/>So how was it done.... apple suspended by meccano, drinking straw threaded into apple &amp; another one out, both straw &amp; meccano threaded through hole in sheet of A4 so it hid rest of support and also concealed the husband, who blew apple juice through the straws ...<br/> <br/>Like I said, had fun doing this, and probably did better than my straight pic of a sliced apple....<br/> <br/></td>', 'Thanks for the comments - I agree the flow of juice is too transparent/apple not green enough/whole thing too ''flat''. This was because, to remove the shadow cast by the meccano that was suspending the apple in mid-air, I held a piece of tracing paper across the window alongside the set-up. Whilst this did a great job of removing the shadow, it left the whole shot looking not properly lit. I tried in PS but still couldn''t get it right. graphicfunk: I see you had fun with the shadow in your similar shot (which was better :-)! )  So how was it done.... apple suspended by meccano, drinking straw threaded into apple & another one out, both straw & meccano threaded through hole in sheet of A4 so it hid rest of support and also concealed the husband, who blew apple juice through the straws ... Like I said, had fun doing this, and probably did better than my straight pic of a sliced apple.... ', '2005-05-25 10:46:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(1411159, 179309, 24642, '<td valign="top">Til hamingju með borðann Lárus.<br/>Þessi mynd er vel að honum komin.  Fersk og hressandi.</td>', 'Til hamingju með borðann Lárus.Þessi mynd er vel að honum komin.  Fersk og hressandi.', '2005-05-25 10:51:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(1411180, 179013, 30817, '<td valign="top">I gotta know .... how many shots did it take to catch the apple in this stem exposing position? Was it tossed by that guy, or dropped from above?</td>', 'I gotta know .... how many shots did it take to catch the apple in this stem exposing position? Was it tossed by that guy, or dropped from above?', '2005-05-25 11:00:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(1411202, 179326, 15305, '<td valign="top">This was my favorite for the challenge. I really thought this was going to be a ribbon!! Congratulations on a great job and keep it up.</td>', 'This was my favorite for the challenge. I really thought this was going to be a ribbon!! Congratulations on a great job and keep it up.', '2005-05-25 11:05:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(1411215, 178438, 31443, '<td valign="top">I gave this photo a 6 because of the brilliant colors. I had no idea that it was by a beginner! So you see Jessica you are considered among the regulars :) I think what got you low scores is the centering of your apple and the flowers and you know what until very recently all my photos were like that and some still! I just cannot get the habit to go away. You have the talent for sure.....</td>', 'I gave this photo a 6 because of the brilliant colors. I had no idea that it was by a beginner! So you see Jessica you are considered among the regulars :) I think what got you low scores is the centering of your apple and the flowers and you know what until very recently all my photos were like that and some still! I just cannot get the habit to go away. You have the talent for sure.....', '2005-05-25 11:08:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(1411352, 179294, 6845, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by smokeditor:</b></div><hr/><i> Excellent Shot, Congrats on the 5th! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Oh my god!!! You do still exsist.  =) Thanks for lookin in.</td>', 'Originally posted by smokeditor: Excellent Shot, Congrats on the 5th!   Oh my god!!! You do still exsist.  =) Thanks for lookin in.', '2005-05-25 11:53:00.000000', NULL, 0),
