(1411424, 178152, 37797, '<td valign="top">there you go! thats good for your first challenge, wish I were doing the same with my first challenge (lighting) It is doing a lot worse...  AND I blame it all on paint shop pro :) Like I said on the thread you''ve posted, you''ve done very well, great idea and a good photo in the end..</td>', 'there you go! thats good for your first challenge, wish I were doing the same with my first challenge (lighting) It is doing a lot worse...  AND I blame it all on paint shop pro :) Like I said on the thread you''ve posted, you''ve done very well, great idea and a good photo in the end..', '2005-05-25 12:21:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(1411426, 177984, 24495, '<td valign="top">Wonderful! You ARE a GRAPHIC funk!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-05-25 11:27:20.</i></td>', 'Wonderful! You ARE a GRAPHIC funk!', '2005-05-25 12:22:25.000000', '2005-05-25 12:27:20.000000', 0),
(1411449, 177799, 24495, '<td valign="top">How you fit it so snuggly!</td>', 'How you fit it so snuggly!', '2005-05-25 12:34:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(1411452, 178438, 11895, '<td valign="top">I liked this one a lot and voted it higher than it''s final score.  The shiny green leaves are a cool background, a few more of them, or perhaps moving in a little closer would have eliminated the less attractive brown in the upper corners.  Very colorful, saturation and sharpness are high but don''t go over the line into being over-sharp or over-saturated.  Keep up the good work and don''t get too preoccupied with scores.</td>', 'I liked this one a lot and voted it higher than it''s final score.  The shiny green leaves are a cool background, a few more of them, or perhaps moving in a little closer would have eliminated the less attractive brown in the upper corners.  Very colorful, saturation and sharpness are high but don''t go over the line into being over-sharp or over-saturated.  Keep up the good work and don''t get too preoccupied with scores.', '2005-05-25 12:35:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(1411484, 179258, 714, '<td valign="top">Pretty good for last minute! Very creative. Congrats!</td>', 'Pretty good for last minute! Very creative. Congrats!', '2005-05-25 12:50:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(1411485, 177627, 37774, '<td valign="top">thanks for the comments, everyone -- just trying to answer any questions left open here. I am aware, it really looks like the apple is moving up, but it was actually falling down. I tried a few snapshots with a plain white background, but that literally only left a green blur.</td>', 'thanks for the comments, everyone -- just trying to answer any questions left open here. I am aware, it really looks like the apple is moving up, but it was actually falling down. I tried a few snapshots with a plain white background, but that literally only left a green blur.', '2005-05-25 12:51:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(1411486, 177646, 19746, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot - pretty surprised it ranked down here but what can you do?  Great interpretation of the original piece and you''ve made slight adjustments which suit ''this medium''.  Bad luck to do so badly with such a cool image.<br/> <br/>Alex</td>', 'I like this a lot - pretty surprised it ranked down here but what can you do?  Great interpretation of the original piece and you''ve made slight adjustments which suit ''this medium''.  Bad luck to do so badly with such a cool image. Alex', '2005-05-25 12:51:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(1411499, 179239, 19746, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by legalbeagle:</b></div><hr/><i> I liked this - amazing detail on the apple skin.  Thought it deserved more than this! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks for the encouragement, man.  I think this shot works better out of an ''apple challenge'' context because as an idea for the apple challenge it''s a bit flat, but as a generic textured macro shot it works.  I think I got grilled by the voters for the simplicity of the subject and the perceived lack of creativity.  <br/> <br/>Strangely enough, I thought this was quite a ''stock photography'' type image which can sometiems do well on DPC - the voters are pretty unpredictable hehe.</td>', 'Originally posted by legalbeagle: I liked this - amazing detail on the apple skin.  Thought it deserved more than this!   Thanks for the encouragement, man.  I think this shot works better out of an ''apple challenge'' context because as an idea for the apple challenge it''s a bit flat, but as a generic textured macro shot it works.  I think I got grilled by the voters for the simplicity of the subject and the perceived lack of creativity.   Strangely enough, I thought this was quite a ''stock photography'' type image which can sometiems do well on DPC - the voters are pretty unpredictable hehe.', '2005-05-25 12:55:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(1411507, 178872, 19746, '<td valign="top">This should have placed a lot higher.  Maybe if you eliminated the shadow on the right hand side a bit more it would have done better but that''s so subtle I''m surprised anyone noticed.  Bad luck on not placing in the top 10 at least :(<br/> <br/>Alex</td>', 'This should have placed a lot higher.  Maybe if you eliminated the shadow on the right hand side a bit more it would have done better but that''s so subtle I''m surprised anyone noticed.  Bad luck on not placing in the top 10 at least :( Alex', '2005-05-25 12:58:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(1411516, 178054, 19746, '<td valign="top">Perhaps this would have done better if you had got both in focus, the eyes and the apples.  Maybe with the model holding the apple up to her face or something (I dunno).  As it is, I really like this shot and I think you should have maybe placed a little higher :/ Her eyes are incredible - good idea for the challenge.<br/> <br/>Alex</td>', 'Perhaps this would have done better if you had got both in focus, the eyes and the apples.  Maybe with the model holding the apple up to her face or something (I dunno).  As it is, I really like this shot and I think you should have maybe placed a little higher :/ Her eyes are incredible - good idea for the challenge. Alex', '2005-05-25 13:03:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(1411522, 179329, 19746, '<td valign="top">This is an incredible effect.  Pity you didn''t do better because there is no denying the quality of this shot.  <br/> <br/>Alex</td>', 'This is an incredible effect.  Pity you didn''t do better because there is no denying the quality of this shot.   Alex', '2005-05-25 13:04:11.000000', NULL, 0),
