(1411564, 179309, 22046, '<td valign="top">Hi Iarus. Loved your response to the person who did not like water shots. You are a gracious person and obviously self-confident and easy-going. Good for you. Your photograph was wonderful and deserved to win the ribbon. I congratulate you. As a "one shot wonder" - at least so far - I hope you will win many more ribbons. I won one on the second challenge I entered and haven''t won one since. ;-) Ah well. But we all keep doing this because we love it and it is fun. And the challenge helps focus our photography on new unexplored topics and to stretch our boundaries. To me that is what you did when you tried the splash shot. And it worked very well. The clear focus and bright colors worked perfectly. Keep up the good work. Regards, Ann</td>', 'Hi Iarus. Loved your response to the person who did not like water shots. You are a gracious person and obviously self-confident and easy-going. Good for you. Your photograph was wonderful and deserved to win the ribbon. I congratulate you. As a "one shot wonder" - at least so far - I hope you will win many more ribbons. I won one on the second challenge I entered and haven''t won one since. ;-) Ah well. But we all keep doing this because we love it and it is fun. And the challenge helps focus our photography on new unexplored topics and to stretch our boundaries. To me that is what you did when you tried the splash shot. And it worked very well. The clear focus and bright colors worked perfectly. Keep up the good work. Regards, Ann', '2005-05-25 13:17:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(1411565, 178345, 37797, '<td valign="top">I gave this photo a ten (along  with 27 others)..Maybe I''m new at this and I''m missing something here, but I certainly cannot understand why people would give it a one, or even two for that matter... I think its absolutely brilliant, and the low scores were rather unfair...</td>', 'I gave this photo a ten (along  with 27 others)..Maybe I''m new at this and I''m missing something here, but I certainly cannot understand why people would give it a one, or even two for that matter... I think its absolutely brilliant, and the low scores were rather unfair...', '2005-05-25 13:17:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(1411664, 178054, 26756, '<td valign="top">You have a stunning little model here, you''re sure to make some great photos of her in the future.<br/> <br/>My idea to change this photo:  <br/>Have her lay down on her back with strong, diffused light in the room or outdoors.  Completely surround her head with green apples so just her face is popping through.  Shoot with a deep dof, maybe F/16 so everything is in complete focus and there you go.  Just an idea for a re-shoot if you wanted to try it.</td>', 'You have a stunning little model here, you''re sure to make some great photos of her in the future. My idea to change this photo:  Have her lay down on her back with strong, diffused light in the room or outdoors.  Completely surround her head with green apples so just her face is popping through.  Shoot with a deep dof, maybe F/16 so everything is in complete focus and there you go.  Just an idea for a re-shoot if you wanted to try it.', '2005-05-25 13:58:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(1411683, 177984, 19503, '<td valign="top">Thought this one was yours :)<br/> <br/>Love the texture of the apple and the "juice", very cool.<br/></td>', 'Thought this one was yours :) Love the texture of the apple and the "juice", very cool.', '2005-05-25 14:06:52.000000', NULL, 0),
