(1411975, 179013, 28882, '<td valign="top"><br/>Actually Ron the apple is held by a rod connected to the wood frame to the left and back.  The apple is blocking the view of its support.  I set my camera on a tripod about a foot from the apple, set the timer and walked out in front and pretended to throw the apple.  Ya that''s me in the shot.  <br/> <br/></td>', 'Actually Ron the apple is held by a rod connected to the wood frame to the left and back.  The apple is blocking the view of its support.  I set my camera on a tripod about a foot from the apple, set the timer and walked out in front and pretended to throw the apple.  Ya that''s me in the shot.   ', '2005-05-25 15:39:39.000000', NULL, 0),
