(1412159, 178438, 5112, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on an excellent finish for a first entry!  I love the way you arranged the apple and the flowers on the leaves.  I like the dandelion right below the apple.  The greens and red are really beautiful, they look so juicy.<br/> <br/>I hope you make many more beautiful pictures - making pictures is just about the funnest thing to do in art.</td>', 'Congratulations on an excellent finish for a first entry!  I love the way you arranged the apple and the flowers on the leaves.  I like the dandelion right below the apple.  The greens and red are really beautiful, they look so juicy. I hope you make many more beautiful pictures - making pictures is just about the funnest thing to do in art.', '2005-05-25 16:58:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(1412186, 178881, 29906, '<td valign="top">I just cannot see how would someone give this shot a 1 or even a 5, the shot is so clean, so crisp, excellent exposure ... Something must be wrong with some voters.</td>', 'I just cannot see how would someone give this shot a 1 or even a 5, the shot is so clean, so crisp, excellent exposure ... Something must be wrong with some voters.', '2005-05-25 17:13:17.000000', NULL, 0),
