(1412687, 179336, 37544, '<td valign="top">You can tell by my comment during the contest that I was right.  Some others were like me and didn''t see the apple at first.  I think that this should have gotten a ribbon! I can''t believe that it didn''t!! Not to downplay the ribbon winners, but this is spectacular!!  I am very proud to be one of the 17 who gave you a 10!</td>', 'You can tell by my comment during the contest that I was right.  Some others were like me and didn''t see the apple at first.  I think that this should have gotten a ribbon! I can''t believe that it didn''t!! Not to downplay the ribbon winners, but this is spectacular!!  I am very proud to be one of the 17 who gave you a 10!', '2005-05-25 21:33:48.000000', NULL, 0),
