(1413174, 179274, 35352, '<td valign="top">This is a cool picture. It''s different to the rest and very striking. Grabs your attention. I really lke the grain of the wood. There seems to be a bright light behind the subject creating that shadow up front. IMO, the apple needs a touch more focus as well.</td>', 'This is a cool picture. It''s different to the rest and very striking. Grabs your attention. I really lke the grain of the wood. There seems to be a bright light behind the subject creating that shadow up front. IMO, the apple needs a touch more focus as well.', '2005-05-26 04:55:32.000000', NULL, 0),
