(1422350, 179391, 16790, '<td valign="top">I''m amazed that this didn''t do better - it''s overall very appealing with the neutral sand colour and the vivid red of the apple; the only thing I would like to see is a slightly tighter crop on the right side and bottom to make the apple more centred in the bottom righthand corner, and to give it a little more negative space to the left.  This has an almost abstract feel to it; it would look lovely with a thick black mat/frame.  Nice job!</td>', 'I''m amazed that this didn''t do better - it''s overall very appealing with the neutral sand colour and the vivid red of the apple; the only thing I would like to see is a slightly tighter crop on the right side and bottom to make the apple more centred in the bottom righthand corner, and to give it a little more negative space to the left.  This has an almost abstract feel to it; it would look lovely with a thick black mat/frame.  Nice job!', '2005-05-31 04:22:12.000000', NULL, 0),
