(1481778, 177967, 16488, '<td valign="top">I never voted on "apple" but I can say I would have given above a 5.<br/> <br/>It''s probably several minor flaws that contributed to its downfall, the oof apple, the too pink hand, the funky piece of grass on the face, the odd blue triangle to the right....all "fixable" with some creative editing.<br/> <br/>What''s great about it?  The composition.  The animal''s expression.  The concept of interaction over the apple.  The detail in the fur.<br/> <br/>Thanks for playing the "closest to 5" game!</td>', 'I never voted on "apple" but I can say I would have given above a 5. It''s probably several minor flaws that contributed to its downfall, the oof apple, the too pink hand, the funky piece of grass on the face, the odd blue triangle to the right....all "fixable" with some creative editing. What''s great about it?  The composition.  The animal''s expression.  The concept of interaction over the apple.  The detail in the fur. Thanks for playing the "closest to 5" game!', '2005-06-24 18:09:59.000000', NULL, 0),
