(1492930, 179268, 37719, '<td valign="top">I gave this an 8.  I love the simplicity of the photo yet the impact is a stark contrast - excellent.  My only criticism would be the window/bright area below the stairs is a little too bright.  Almost distracting.  But my eye was always drawn to the apple.  Nice photo!</td>', 'I gave this an 8.  I love the simplicity of the photo yet the impact is a stark contrast - excellent.  My only criticism would be the window/bright area below the stairs is a little too bright.  Almost distracting.  But my eye was always drawn to the apple.  Nice photo!', '2005-06-29 19:42:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(1497173, 178137, 35316, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by mrsmaxsmart:</b></div><hr/><i> pity you used the old motion blur on this one </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Pity yourself...<br/> <br/>I used no such filter!  I used a low shutter speed and zoomed out while the shutter was open to create this.  <br/> <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by mrsmaxsmart: pity you used the old motion blur on this one   Pity yourself... I used no such filter!  I used a low shutter speed and zoomed out while the shutter was open to create this.   ', '2005-07-01 10:25:02.000000', NULL, 0),
