(1522820, 179309, 39221, '<td valign="top">awesome shot larus, gave me inspirtation for some of my own :-)<br/> <br/>as for some of the comments below, from some people perhaps a little jealous, I can''t believe them and think you handled them perfectly :-)<br/> <br/>Look forward to seeing your future efforts ;-)</td>', 'awesome shot larus, gave me inspirtation for some of my own :-) as for some of the comments below, from some people perhaps a little jealous, I can''t believe them and think you handled them perfectly :-) Look forward to seeing your future efforts ;-)', '2005-07-10 06:01:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(1524683, 177857, 23458, '<td valign="top">DOF is a little too shallow here - that''s what''ll happen with an aperture of 2.8. Otherwise it''s a nice idea, and I really like the black and white treatment.</td>', 'DOF is a little too shallow here - that''s what''ll happen with an aperture of 2.8. Otherwise it''s a nice idea, and I really like the black and white treatment.', '2005-07-11 01:01:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(1527472, 177645, 39221, '<td valign="top">lol I love your philosphy, as Simon says "You can''t take away people''s right to be assholes."<br/> <br/>also one of my fave films, and actors :-)<br/> <br/>I think if anything the stalk ruins the look...<br/> <br/>I''d sure like to know how you got inside the apple to bang those nails out though ;-)</td>', 'lol I love your philosphy, as Simon says "You can''t take away people''s right to be assholes." also one of my fave films, and actors :-) I think if anything the stalk ruins the look... I''d sure like to know how you got inside the apple to bang those nails out though ;-)', '2005-07-11 16:34:24.000000', NULL, 0),
