(1558898, 177476, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love your jocular take on "adam''s apple."  HEE HEE  People just don''t get it do they????  I think it''s a total hoot. Great detail and color adds to this fun shot.  Thanks for the laugh. I just ran across this under the humorous category.</td>', 'I love your jocular take on "adam''s apple."  HEE HEE  People just don''t get it do they????  I think it''s a total hoot. Great detail and color adds to this fun shot.  Thanks for the laugh. I just ran across this under the humorous category.', '2005-07-24 15:02:31.000000', NULL, 0),
