(1758517, 178438, 41845, '<td valign="top">Jessica - GOOD JOB.  Really nice work good focus, composition and lighting.  By the way I think it''s a great thing that you have something that you can do together with your Mom! Can''t wait to see your next entry.</td>', 'Jessica - GOOD JOB.  Really nice work good focus, composition and lighting.  By the way I think it''s a great thing that you have something that you can do together with your Mom! Can''t wait to see your next entry.', '2005-10-04 16:53:03.000000', NULL, 0),
