(1864488, 179129, 15711, '<td valign="top">Just ran across this in your portfolio.  I like the crispness (no pun intended) of it very much.  I have a thing for apples anyway and this does not disappoint.  Good use of negative space and I like the unusual placement of it on its side. The light and shadow is great. Very nice closeup with good detailing.</td>', 'Just ran across this in your portfolio.  I like the crispness (no pun intended) of it very much.  I have a thing for apples anyway and this does not disappoint.  Good use of negative space and I like the unusual placement of it on its side. The light and shadow is great. Very nice closeup with good detailing.', '2005-11-14 09:00:36.000000', NULL, 0),
