(2091235, 179246, 22689, '<td valign="top">Your textile projects seem to be very , very interesting.<br/>Is there a website where to learn how to do that ?</td>', 'Your textile projects seem to be very , very interesting.Is there a website where to learn how to do that ?', '2006-01-27 05:08:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(2092389, 179246, 35804, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Mambe:</b></div><hr/><i> Your textile projects seem to be very , very interesting.<br/>Is there a website where to learn how to do that ? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks Mambe  : }<br/> <br/>There most likely isn''t a website on how to do intaglio printmaking...it''s so hands on...chemicals, presses, ink, metal printing plates etc...I looked but I couldn''t find one... I did have a  good page that explains printmaking processes <a href="//www.crownpoint.com/printmaking/processp.html" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">here</a>.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by Mambe: Your textile projects seem to be very , very interesting.Is there a website where to learn how to do that ?   Thanks Mambe  : } There most likely isn''t a website on how to do intaglio printmaking...it''s so hands on...chemicals, presses, ink, metal printing plates etc...I looked but I couldn''t find one... I did have a  good page that explains printmaking processes here. ', '2006-01-27 13:58:10.000000', NULL, 0),
